      ],
      "exp_en": "A breach is, generally, an impermissible use or disclosure under the Privacy Rule that compromises the security or privacy of protected health information such that the use or disclosure poses a significant risk of financial, reputation, or other harm to the affected individual. Following a breach of unsecured protected health information covered entities must provide notification of the breach to 1) individual notice: covered entities must notify affected individuals following the discovery of a breach of unsecured protected health information. Covered entities must provide this individual notice in written form by first-class mail, or alternatively, by e-mail if the affected individual has agreed to receive such notices electronically. 2) secretary: the HHS Secretary should be notified by visiting the HHS web site and filling out and electronically submitting a breach report form. 3) media: in certain circumstances, the media must be notified if the breach affects more than 500 residents of a State or jurisdiction by issuing a press release to the appropriate media outlets serving the affected area. 4) business associates: if a breach occurs at or by a business associate, the business associate must notify the covered entity following the discovery of the breach. A business associate must provide notice to the covered entity without unreasonable delay and no later than 60 days from the discovery of the breach. www.hhs.gov/hipaa/",
      "exp_hant": "一般而言,外洩是指在隱私規則下不被允許的使用或揭露,且此使用或揭露危及受保護健康資訊的安全性或隱私,使受影響個人面臨財務、名譽或其他損害的重大風險。在發生未受保護的健康資訊外洩後,涵蓋實體必須就此外洩事件進行通報:1)個人通知:涵蓋實體必須在發現未受保護健康資訊外洩後,通知受影響的個人。涵蓋實體必須以書面形式透過一般郵件提供此個人通知,或者若受影響個人已同意以電子方式接收此類通知,則可透過電子郵件提供。2)秘書(部長)通知:應透過造訪HHS網站並填寫及電子提交外洩報告表,通知HHS部長。3)媒體:在某些情況下,若外洩事件影響某一州或轄區超過500名居民,則必須透過向服務該受影響地區的相關媒體發布新聞稿的方式通知媒體。4)業務夥伴:若外洩事件發生於業務夥伴處或由業務夥伴造成,該業務夥伴必須在發現外洩後通知涵蓋實體。業務夥伴必須在發現外洩後不得無故遲延地通知涵蓋實體,且不得超過60天。www.hhs.gov/hipaa/"
