      "exp_en": "The Chief herbs are cang er zi and xin yi hua. The Deputy herb is bai zhi. The Assistant herb is bo he. The Envoy herb is cong bai and green tea. The main actions of the formula are to disperse wind, alleviate pain, and unblock the nose. The formula unblock the deep cause of nasal congestion by dispelling wind and unblocking the orifices. The chief herbs are cang er zi and xin yi hua are acrid-warm, unblock the nose, and treat profuse nasal discharges. The deputy herb bai zhi is acrid-warming-aromatic which releases the exterior, opens up the orifices, disperses wind-damp, and discharges pus. The assistant herb bo he is acrid-cooling and releases exterior wind-heat, and clears the eyes and head. The herb bo he is supported by cong bai which is the envoy herb. The green tea is the other envoy which clears the head and directs qi down to balance ascending-acrid nature of the other herbs. Formulas and Strategies, Bensky, 2nd Edition, page 628",
      "exp_hant": "君藥為蒼耳子與辛夷花。臣藥為白芷。佐藥為薄荷。使藥為蔥白與綠茶。此方的主要功用為疏散風邪、止痛、通鼻竅。此方透過疏風通竅來治療鼻塞的深層病因。君藥蒼耳子與辛夷花性辛溫,能通鼻竅,治療大量鼻涕。臣藥白芷辛溫芳香,能解表、通竅、袪風濕、排膿。佐藥薄荷辛涼,能解表風熱,並清頭目。薄荷由使藥蔥白輔助。綠茶為另一使藥,能清頭目,並引氣下行,以平衡其他藥物升散辛燥之性。Formulas and Strategies, Bensky, 2nd Edition, page 628"
