    {
      "number": 57,
      "question_en": "A 49 year-old woke up with her mouth and eye deviated. She also had a right sided headache, with pounding sensation in the right eye with watery discharge and with an inability to close it. She also has discomfort at the vertex. Examination shows no wrinkles on the right side of her forehead and the right side nasolabial fold being less pronounced with right side of the mouth drooping. When asked to smile, four teeth could be seen on the left and only two on the right due to the paralysis. Since the facial paralysis she has had palpitations, insomnia, and bitter mouth taste. She does not experience thirst and dry stool. Appetite and urination are normal. The tongue is a little redder than normal with a light yellow and slightly thick coating. The pulse is soft on both sides and sunken on the right side. Blood pressure is 130/80, Pulse 70, Respirations 18, and Temperature 98.6 F. MRI of the brain finds normal T1 and T2 weighted images, no abnormalities visualized Audiometry is stable bilaterally. She is diagnosed with Bell's Palsy. She is treated on the right side with GB-14 (yang bai) through the extra point yu yao, extra point tai yang through ST-6 (jia che), ST-4 (di cang) through ST-6 (jia che), ST-3 (juliao) through LI-20 (ying xiang). Bilaterally, she is treated with GB-20 (feng chi), LI- 11 (qu chi), TB-7 (hui zong), and GB-8 (shuai gu). She was treated six times and all her symptoms resolved except for a slight mouth deviation when she smiled. She was then treated with the facial points without any threading. After four more treatments she recovered. Three days later, she returned complaining of dizziness, heavy head sensation, right forehead pain, difficulty falling asleep, nightmares, restlessness, and a dry mouth. The tongue was a little dark red with a white, dry, and little thick coating. The pulse was sunken, thin, and slippery. Which of the following treatments would you now choose?",
      "question_hant": "一名49歲女性醒來時發現嘴巴與眼睛歪斜。她也有右側頭痛,右眼有搏動感並伴隨流淚,且無法閉眼。她在頭頂處也有不適感。檢查顯示右側前額無皺紋,右側鼻唇溝變淺,右側嘴角下垂。要求她微笑時,左側可見四顆牙齒,右側因麻痺僅能見到兩顆。自從顏面麻痺以來,她出現心悸、失眠及口苦。她沒有口渴及大便乾燥的情形。食慾與排尿正常。舌質略紅於正常,舌苔淡黃且略厚。脈象雙側皆軟,右側沉。血壓130/80,脈搏70,呼吸18次,體溫98.6華氏度。腦部MRI顯示T1與T2加權影像正常,未見異常。雙側聽力檢查(Audiometry)穩定正常。她被診斷為貝爾氏麻痺(Bell's Palsy)。右側治療取陽白(GB-14)透魚腰(extra point yu yao)、太陽(extra point tai yang)透頰車(ST-6)、地倉(ST-4)透頰車(ST-6)、巨髎(ST-3)透迎香(LI-20)。雙側則取風池(GB-20)、曲池(LI-11)、會宗(TB-7)及率谷(GB-8)。她接受了六次治療後,除了微笑時仍有輕微嘴角歪斜外,其餘症狀皆已消退。之後以顏面穴位治療,不加透刺。再經過四次治療後她痊癒了。三天後,她回診主訴頭暈、頭部沉重感、右前額疼痛、入睡困難、噩夢、躁動不安,以及口乾。舌質略帶暗紅,舌苔白、乾且略厚。脈沉細而滑。您現在會選擇下列哪一種治療?",
      "image": null,
