      "exp_en": "Kidney Yang Deficiency with Water Overflowing. The treatment principle is to Tonify and Warm the Kidneys, Tonify and Warm Spleen Yang, Transform Water (if Water Overflows to the Heart or Lungs then Warm-Tonify Heart Yang or Lung Qi). DU-4 (ming men) strengthens yang Fire to promote Water transformation. BL-23 (shen shu) tonifies Kidney yang. REN-9 (shui fen) transforms fluids. SP-6 (san yin jiao) and SP-9 (yin ling quan) transform lower jiao dampness. KI-7 (fu liu) strengthens Kidney yang and alleviates edema. Additional points to consider for transformation of fluids in the lower jiao are BL-22 (san jiao shu) and ST-28 (shui dao). If there are additional symptoms of water overflowing to the Heart (palpitations, SOB, cold hands) moxa on DU-14 (da zhui) adding BL-15 (xin shu) which strengthens Heart yang can be included in the formula. If there are additional symptoms of water overflowing to the Lungs (watery-frothy sputum, cough, wheezing, SOB with activity), the point LU-7 (lieque). which descends Lung qi and regulates the water passages (the points BL-13 (fei shu) and DU-12 (shen zhu) that tonify Lung qi can be included in the formula); all points are tonified EXCEPT the points which transform dampness are reduced; moxa is applicable",
