        {
          "key": "D",
          "en": "opening the mouth triggers TN pain while gently touching the face triggers TMJ pain",
          "hant": "張口會誘發TN疼痛，輕觸臉部則會誘發TMJ疼痛",
          "correct": false
        }
      ],
      "exp_en": "In general, Trigeminal neuralgia pain is sharp, shooting, like an electric nerve radiating through the face. The pain can be spontaneous, not necessarily triggered by jaw movement. TMJ disorders are characterized by pain that is dull, achy, throbbing in quality. The pain is usually aggravated by jaw movement. The 3rd Cranial Nerve is the occulomotor nerve. Trigeminal neuralgia affects the 5th cranial nerve which has three branches. The ophthalmic or the upper branch supplies sensation to most of the scalp and forehead. The maxillary or middle branch stimulates the upper jaw, top lip, teeth and gums, and to the side of the nose. The mandibular or branch supplies nerves to the lower jaw, teeth and gums, and bottom lip. The most common type of TMJ disorder is due to the displaced oval-shaped articular disc. The articular disc is located in the joint between the condylar head of the mandible and the mandibular fossa of the temporal bone. TMJ occurs when the disc slips out of its proper position. Trigeminal neuralgia is treated with anticonvulsant drugs, such as carbamazepine to block nerve firing, antidepressants or surgery. TMJ is treated with remedial dental work, oral splints, pain relievers, and anti-inflammatories. Generally, opening the mouth triggers TMJ pain while gently touching the face can trigger TN pain. TRIGEMINAL NEURALGIA: It is often caused by a blood vessel pressing against the trigeminal nerve. The artery rubbing against the nerve wears away the nerve's myelin sheath which then exposes the nerve making. Trigeminal neuralgia may also be part of other disorders (MS, stroke, local tumor). The pain is stabbing, lancinating, electrical or a constant aching, burning feeling. With trigeminal neuralgia, even a mild stimulation of the face (brushing teeth, touching the face, applying makeup) can trigger a jolt of excruciating pain. Diagnosis is based mainly on the history, description of symptoms, and physical and neurological examinations. An MRI can be done to rule out a tumor. Treatment is through anticonvulsant drugs to block nerve firing, antidepressants or surgery. TEMPOROMANDIBULAR JOINT DISORDER: The most common cause for TMJ is a displaced oval-shaped articular disc in the jaw joint. There is jaw pain, clicking noises while opening or closing the jaw, locking of the jaw, headaches, ear pain, or neck pain. Due to stress patients often grind their teeth at night. TMJ can also be due to arthritis or degenerative joint disease. Diagnosis is through history and physical examination, listening to and palpating the jaw while opening and closing the mouth. Dental x-rays of the teeth and jaw can be done. Treatment can include remedial dental work, oral splints or mouth guards, pain relievers, anti-inflammatories, or muscle relaxants. Differential Diagnosis of Common Complaints, Sellers and Symons, 7th Edition, page 161; mayoclinic.com; nih.gov",
      "exp_hant": "一般而言，三叉神經痛的疼痛呈銳利、放射性，如電流般竄過臉部。此疼痛可自發產生，不一定由下頜運動所誘發。顳顎關節障礙的特徵則是疼痛呈鈍痛、痠痛、跳動性，通常因下頜運動而加劇。第三對腦神經為動眼神經。三叉神經痛影響的是第五對腦神經，該神經有三個分支：眼支（上支）支配大部分頭皮及前額的感覺；上頜支（中支）支配上頜、上唇、牙齒與牙齦，以及鼻側；下頜支支配下頜、牙齒與牙齦，以及下唇。TMJ最常見的原因是卵圓形關節盤移位。關節盤位於下頜骨髁突與顳骨下頜窩之間的關節內。當關節盤滑離正常位置時即發生TMJ障礙。三叉神經痛的治療包括抗癲癇藥物（如carbamazepine以阻斷神經放電）、抗憂鬱藥或手術。TMJ的治療則包括牙科矯治、咬合板、止痛藥及消炎藥。一般而言，張口會誘發TMJ疼痛，而輕觸臉部則可能誘發三叉神經痛。三叉神經痛：常由血管壓迫三叉神經所致。動脈摩擦神經導致其髓鞘磨損，使神經暴露。三叉神經痛也可能是其他疾病的一部分（如多發性硬化症、中風、局部腫瘤）。疼痛呈刺痛、劇痛、電擊樣，或持續性痠痛、灼熱感。患有三叉神經痛時，即使是臉部的輕微刺激（刷牙、觸碰臉部、化妝）都可能誘發劇烈疼痛發作。診斷主要依據病史、症狀描述，以及理學與神經學檢查。可進行MRI以排除腫瘤。治療方式為抗癲癇藥物以阻斷神經放電、抗憂鬱藥或手術。顳顎關節障礙：TMJ最常見的病因是頜關節內卵圓形關節盤移位。症狀包括下頜疼痛、開閉口時有喀喀聲、下頜卡住、頭痛、耳痛或頸痛。因壓力，患者常在夜間磨牙。TMJ也可能由關節炎或退化性關節疾病所致。診斷透過病史詢問與理學檢查，並在開閉口時聽診及觸診下頜。可進行牙齒與下頜的X光檢查。治療可包括牙科矯治、咬合板或護齒套、止痛藥、消炎藥或肌肉鬆弛劑。Differential Diagnosis of Common Complaints, Sellers and Symons, 7th Edition, page 161; mayoclinic.com; nih.gov"
