    {
      "number": 104,
      "question_en": "A 21 year-old female has dysmenorrhea as the chief complaint. There is lower abdominal pain before menstruation, delayed and scanty menstrual flow which is dark with clots, and breast distention. The tongue has purplish spots. The pulse is wiry. The prescription given is REN-3 (zhong ji), BL-32 (ci liao), LR-3 (tai chong), SP-10 (xue hai), SP-8 (di ji), and LI-4 (he gu). She returns the next day and reports general improvement. However, the lower abdominal pain shows no amelioration and upon palpation you can feel a hard mass. What points would you add to the prescription?",
      "question_hant": "一名21歲女性以痛經為主訴。經前下腹疼痛，月經延遲且量少，經血色暗夾血塊，並有乳房脹痛。舌有紫斑，脈弦。給予的處方為中極（REN-3）、次髎（BL-32）、太衝（LR-3）、血海（SP-10）、地機（SP-8）及合谷（LI-4）。隔日回診，患者表示整體症狀有所改善，但下腹疼痛未見緩解，觸診可摸到一硬塊。您應在處方中加入哪些穴位？",
