        }
      ],
      "exp_en": "Dysmenorrhea can be either an excess syndrome (blood stasis) or a deficiency syndrome (blood deficiency). In the excess syndrome the flow of blood is impaired by Liver qi stasis creating a disharmony between the ren mai and chong mai resulting in blood stasis in the uterus which manifests as pain. The qi and blood stasis can also be caused by external cold (cold drinks and food) lodging itself in the uterus and causing pain. In the excess syndrome the menstruation is delayed and the pain starts before menstruation and is relieved by the blood flowing. In the deficiency syndrome an insufficient amount of qi and blood drains the Sea of Blood and deprives and fails to nourish the uterus resulting in pain. The deficiency pattern also has delayed menstrual cycle with a gradual decrease of menses even to the point of amenorrhea. This patient has the excess blood stasis type. REN-3 dredges Lower Jiao blockages to qi and blood circulation. BL-32 regulates menstruation and is an empirical point for dysmenorrhea. SP-10 and SP-8 invigorate and move blood to resolve stasis. LR-3 moves the stuck Liver qi. LI-4 regulates qi and blood flow and eliminates pain. This prescription lacks sufficient local points to address the blood stagnation (hard mass) in the uterus. ST-29 removes blood stasis in the uterus and KI-14 dispels blood stasis and moves blood in the lower jiao. KI-14 is effective when there is pain that is worse from pressure due to a blood stasis hard mass. The other point combinations do not fully specifically address the blood stasis in the lower abdomen. CAM, 3rd Edition, page 475; CAM, 4th Edition, page 576",
      "exp_hant": "痛經可分為實證（血瘀）與虛證（血虛）兩類。實證中，肝氣鬱滯影響血行，造成任脈與衝脈失調，導致胞宮血瘀而表現為疼痛。氣血瘀滯亦可因外寒（食冷飲、食冷物）滯留胞宮而致痛。實證痛經月經多延遲，疼痛始於經前，血行後疼痛得減。虛證則因氣血不足，耗傷血海，胞宮失於濡養而致痛，並見月經週期延後、經量漸少，甚至閉經。本案患者屬實證血瘀型。中極（REN-3）疏通下焦氣血阻滯；次髎（BL-32）調經，為治療痛經之經驗效穴；血海（SP-10）與地機（SP-8）活血化瘀；太衝（LR-3）疏泄肝氣鬱結；合谷（LI-4）調理氣血、止痛。此處方局部穴位不足，未能充分處理胞宮的血瘀（硬塊）。歸來（ST-29）可袪除胞宮血瘀，四滿（KI-14）能袪瘀活血、調理下焦氣血。當因血瘀硬塊而按壓加重疼痛時，四滿尤為有效。其他穴位組合皆未能充分針對下腹的血瘀問題。CAM, 3rd Edition, page 475; CAM, 4th Edition, page 576"
