    {
      "number": 112,
      "question_en": "Three days ago a 55 year-old female patient returns for her monthly checkup. She was originally being treated for menopause due to yin deficiency. She now reports having caught a cold with slight fever, chills, a runny nose with a yellow discharge, a sore throat and a cough. The tip of her tongue is red. The pulse is rapid. She is treated with LI-4 (hegu), LI-11 (quchi), DU-14 (dazhui), BL-12 (fengmen), TB-5 (waiguan) She returns one week later. She reports a worsening of her condition. The cough is worse. There is now shortness of breath, a desire to chew on ice, and chest aches. She feels hot at night without a need to cover herself. Body temperature is 102 F. The tongue is red with a yellow coating. The pulse is overflowing-rapid. The treatment given is LU-5 (chize), LU-10 (yuji), LU-7 (lieque), LI-11 (quchi), and BL-13 (feishu). On her scheduled appointment one week later, she says her feverish sensations have subsided and feels better. One month later she calls for an appointment. She reports dry skin, mental agitation, thirst, cough, a dry throat and dry stools. She reports that her urine is dark and scanty. The tongue is red without coating. The pulse is fine-rapid, reverting back to the pulse she had when being treated for menopause. She is most concerned with a sense of weakness of her left leg. She feels that sometimes she is dragging her foot. She denies any leg or back pain. Which of the following treatments would you select?",
      "question_hant": "三天前，一名55歲女性患者回診接受每月例行治療，原本因陰虛所致的更年期症狀而接受治療。她表示現在感冒了，出現輕微發熱、惡寒、流黃涕、喉嚨痛及咳嗽。舌尖紅，脈數。當時給予的治療為合谷（LI-4）、曲池（LI-11）、大椎（DU-14）、風門（BL-12）、外關（TB-5）。一週後她再次回診，表示病情惡化，咳嗽加重，出現氣短、想嚼冰塊，以及胸部悶痛。夜間發熱卻不需蓋被。體溫達華氏102度。舌紅苔黃，脈洪數。此時給予的治療為尺澤（LU-5）、魚際（LU-10）、列缺（LU-7）、曲池（LI-11）及肺俞（BL-13）。一週後依約回診，她表示發熱感已消退，感覺好轉。一個月後她致電預約看診，表示皮膚乾燥、心神不寧、口渴、咳嗽、咽喉乾燥及大便乾結。她表示小便短赤。舌紅無苔，脈細數，恢復為先前治療更年期時的脈象。她最擔心的是左腿感到無力，有時覺得拖著腳走路。她否認有腿部或腰部疼痛。您會選擇下列哪一項治療？",
      "image": null,
