      "exp_en": "The diagnosis is Liver and Heart Blood Deficiency, Stagnant Liver Qi. The treatment principle is to Nourish Liver and Heart Blood. LR-3 and GB-34 resolve Liver qi stagnation. PC-7 calms the Liver and calms the Ethereal Soul. ST-36 and SP-6 tonify qi and Blood. BL-20 and BL-18 nourish the Liver and Heart Blood. In this case the Yin Linking Vessel (right PC-6 and left SP-4) can be opened to nourish Blood and calm the Mind. The Blood deficiency was most likely due to loss of blood after childbirth leading to post-natal depression (cries a lot). The Liver Blood deficiency shows as constipation, excess dreaming, pale tongue, and thin pulse. This deficiency also caused a Heart-Blood deficiency showing as insomnia and palpitations. The Liver Blood deficiency gave rise to stagnant Liver qi (PMS). The Practice of Chinese Medicine, Maciocia, 1994, page 771-772; this case is not included in the 2008 edition",
      "exp_hant": "診斷為肝血虛、心血虛，兼肝氣鬱滯。治療原則為養肝血與心血。太衝（LR-3）與陽陵泉（GB-34）疏解肝氣鬱滯。大陵（PC-7）平肝、安魂。足三里（ST-36）與三陰交（SP-6）補益氣血。脾俞（BL-20）與肝俞（BL-18）滋養肝血與心血。此案亦可開通陰維脈（右內關配左公孫）以養血安神。此血虛很可能是產後失血所致，進而引發產後憂鬱（經常哭泣）。肝血虛表現為便秘、多夢及舌淡、脈細。此虛損亦導致心血虛，表現為失眠與心悸。肝血虛進而導致肝氣鬱滯（經前症候群）。The Practice of Chinese Medicine, Maciocia, 1994, page 771-772; this case is not included in the 2008 edition"
