        {
          "key": "C",
          "en": "wear gloves and eye protection",
          "hant": "配戴手套及護目裝備",
          "correct": true
        },
        {
          "key": "D",
          "en": "wear eye protection only when bleeding the point",
          "hant": "僅於點刺出血時配戴護目裝備",
          "correct": false
        }
      ],
      "exp_en": "Wet cupping involves both blood-letting and cupping. The practitioner must create a clean field that includes the lancet, the cups, and lubricant. The practitioner must wash their hands. The area to be cupped must be cleaned thoroughly with an alcohol swab or with soap and water. Wear both gloves and eye protection. Use a sterile single use lancet to draw blood followed by cupping of the area. Discard the lancet directly and immediately into the sharps container after use. If the practitioner has removed either gloves or goggles after the procedure, the gloves and eye protection must be used on for cup removal. Stop any continued bleeding through use of appropriate pressure using sterile gauze. Immediately isolate the cups. Clean up any bleeding that has occurred. It is strongly recommended to clean the site of the puncture with an appropriate skin cleanser. Discard extravasated blood in the biohazard trash. Immediately wash cups with soap and water. Remove goggles and gloves and dispose them according to the clinic's OSHA standard. Wash hands with soap and water. It is critical to either clean the cups of any biological material with soap and water and lubricant followed by a high-level disinfection solution or through autoclave. Alternately, the contaminated cups can be immediate discarded in the biohazard trash. Also, clean equipment surface and table with an appropriate disinfectant solution. CNT Manual, 7th Edition, page 118",
      "exp_hant": "濕拔罐同時包含刺絡放血與拔罐。執業者須備妥潔淨的操作區域，包括刺絡針、罐具及潤滑劑。執業者須先洗手。拔罐部位須以酒精棉片或肥皂水徹底清潔。施術時須同時配戴手套及護目裝備。使用單次使用之無菌刺絡針刺血，再於該處拔罐。刺絡針使用後須立即直接丟棄於利器盒中。若執業者於操作過程中曾脫下手套或護目鏡，於起罐時仍須重新配戴手套及護目裝備。以無菌紗布施加適當壓力以止住持續出血。立即將罐具隔離處理。清理任何已發生的出血。強烈建議以適當的皮膚清潔劑清潔穿刺部位。將溢出的血液丟棄於生物危害廢棄物中。立即以肥皂水清洗罐具。依診所之OSHA標準取下護目鏡及手套並妥善丟棄。以肥皂水洗手。務必將罐具上任何生物性物質以肥皂水及潤滑劑清潔後，再以高效消毒溶液處理或高溫高壓滅菌；亦可選擇將受污染的罐具立即丟棄於生物危害廢棄物中。此外，亦須以適當消毒液清潔設備表面及檯面。CNT Manual, 7th Edition, page 118"
