      "exp_en": "Gonorrhea is a common sexually transmitted infection (STI). The bacteria Neisseria gonorrhoea causes gonorrhea. Any type of sex can transmit gonorrhea as the infection can be spread by contact with the mouth, vagina, penis, or anus. Symptoms usually appear 2 to 5 days after infection. In men, symptoms may take up to a month to appear while some people do not have symptoms. For men the symptoms may include burning urination, increase urinary frequency, urethral discharge (white, yellow, or green in color), swollen urethral opening, swollen testicles, and sore throat. For women the symptoms can include vaginal discharge, burning urination, frequent urination, painful sex, sore throat, severe lower abdominal pain.",
      "exp_hant": "淋病是一種常見的性傳染病（STI），由淋病奈瑟氏菌所引起。任何形式的性接觸皆可能傳播淋病，因其可透過口腔、陰道、陰莖或肛門的接觸而傳染。症狀通常於感染後2至5天出現。男性的症狀可能需長達一個月才會出現，部分患者則完全無症狀。男性症狀可能包括排尿灼熱感、頻尿、尿道分泌物（白色、黃色或綠色）、尿道口腫脹、睪丸腫脹及喉嚨痛。女性症狀則可能包括陰道分泌物、排尿灼熱感、頻尿、性交疼痛、喉嚨痛及嚴重下腹部疼痛。"
