      "exp_en": "The herb du zhong is sweet, slightly acrid, and warm. The herb sha ren is acrid, warm, and aromatic. The herb zi su yi is acrid, aromatic, and warm. The herb bai zhu treats restless fetus disorder particularly due to spleen xu. Spleen qi xu can lead to malnutrition that can cause a restless fetus. Fetal qi is associated with the spleen. If the spleen is weak then the dai mai (girdle vessel) has no support and a miscarriage can occur. Chen notes that the dry-fried form is used to stabilize pregnancy. The herb bai zhu can be used for calm the fetus due to different etiologies (heat, qi xu, kidney xu, qi stasis) by combining it with other herbs. The herb bai zhu combined with huang qin (radix scutellariae) treats a restless fetus due to internal heat. Combined with ren shen (radix ginseng) and huang qi (radix astragalus) treats a restless fetus due to qi xu. Combined with sang ji sheng (herba taxilli) and du zhong (cortex eucommiae) treats a restless fetus due to kidney xu. Combined with zi su geng (caulis perillae) and chen pi (pericarpium citri) treats a restless fetus due to qi stasis. Combined with shu di huang (radix rhemanniae) and bai shao (radix peoniae) treats a restless fetus due blood xu. The herb tonifies the spleen qi, dries dampness, and calms the fetus. It is bitter, sweet, and warm. It enters the spleen and stomach. It is contraindicated in internal heat arising from yin xu or with thirst arising from exhausted body fluids. Materia Medica, 3rd Edition, Bensky, page 726; Chinese Medical Herbology and Pharmacology, Chen and Chen, 2004, page 857",
      "exp_hant": "杜仲味甘，微辛，性溫。砂仁味辛、性溫、氣芳香。紫蘇葉味辛、氣芳香、性溫。白朮主治胎動不安，尤其是因脾虛所致者。脾氣虛可導致胎兒失養而胎動不安。胎氣與脾相關，若脾虛則帶脈失於固攝，可能導致流產。陳氏指出安胎時常用炒白朮。白朮可因應不同病因（熱、氣虛、腎虛、氣滯）配伍其他藥物以安胎。白朮配黃芩治療因內熱所致之胎動不安；配人參及黃耆治療因氣虛所致之胎動不安；配桑寄生及杜仲治療因腎虛所致之胎動不安；配紫蘇梗及陳皮治療因氣滯所致之胎動不安；配熟地黃及白芍治療因血虛所致之胎動不安。白朮能補脾氣、燥濕、安胎。其味苦、甘，性溫，入脾、胃經。凡因陰虛內熱，或津液耗傷所致口渴者，忌用。Materia Medica, 3rd Edition, Bensky, page 726; Chinese Medical Herbology and Pharmacology, Chen and Chen, 2004, page 857"
