      "exp_en": "Edema in pregnancy can be due to deficiency (Spleen Yang Xu, Kidney Yang Xu) or excess (Liver Qi Stasis). The latter is also called Qi Edema. In edema due to deficiency, there is an accumulation of water under the skin. In edema due to qi stasis, there is accumulation of dampness under the skin. The main difference in the diagnosis is that in deficiency based edema there is pitting of the skin on pressure (the indentation remains after removing the thumb) while in edema due to qi stasis there is no pitting of the skin (the indentation quickly springs back after removing the thumb). The tongue in qi stasis can often be normal if the stasis is recent or not severe. The original prescription focused on tonifying the Spleen and resolving edema. The second prescription focused on moving the qi and resolving dampness. TB-6, LR-3, and GB-34 move Liver Qi to eliminate stasis. REN-9 and BL-22 promote the transformation of fluids to resolve dampness. ST-36 can be selected in any type of edema. In edema the space between the skin and muscles is flooded with body fluids rather than wei qi. ST-36 brings back the wei qi in the space between the skin and muscles and drives the body fluids out. The Rx with BL-23 focused on tonifying the Kidneys and resolving dampness. Obstetrics and Gynecology in Chinese Medicine, Maciocia, 1998, page 494, 497; The Practice of Chinese Medicine, Maciocia, 2008, page 960;",
      "exp_hant": "妊娠水腫可因虛（脾陽虛、腎陽虛）或實（肝氣鬱滯）所致，後者亦稱為氣腫。虛證水腫者，水液積聚於皮下；氣滯水腫者，濕邪積聚於皮下。兩者診斷上的主要差異在於：虛證水腫按壓皮膚會出現凹陷（移開拇指後凹陷仍存在），而氣滯水腫則按壓後皮膚不會凹陷（移開拇指後皮膚立即回彈）。若氣滯病程較短或程度較輕，舌象往往仍屬正常。原處方著重於補脾及消水腫；第二組處方則著重於行氣及化濕。支溝（TB-6）、太衝（LR-3）及陽陵泉（GB-34）能行肝氣以消除氣滯。水分（REN-9）及三焦俞（BL-22）能促進水液氣化以化濕。足三里（ST-36）則適用於各類水腫，因水腫時皮膚與肌肉間的空隙為體液所充斥而非衛氣所在，足三里能使衛氣重返皮肉之間，並驅逐體液外出。以腎俞（BL-23）為主的處方則著重於補腎及化濕。Obstetrics and Gynecology in Chinese Medicine, Maciocia, 1998, page 494, 497; The Practice of Chinese Medicine, Maciocia, 2008, page 960;"
