    {
      "number": 191,
      "question_en": "What is an accurate comparison between endometriosis and Pelvic Inflammatory Disease (PID)?",
      "question_hant": "關於子宮內膜異位症與骨盆腔發炎疾病（PID）之間的比較，下列敘述何者正確？",
      "image": null,
      "options": [
        {
          "key": "A",
          "en": "endometriosis is caused by trichomonas and PID is caused by chlamydia",
          "hant": "子宮內膜異位症由陰道滴蟲引起，PID由披衣菌引起",
          "correct": false
        },
        {
          "key": "B",
          "en": "both can be treated with oral contraceptives and antibiotics",
          "hant": "兩者皆可以口服避孕藥及抗生素治療",
          "correct": false
        },
        {
          "key": "C",
          "en": "both have pelvic pain, dysuria, dyspareunia, and dysmenorrhea",
          "hant": "兩者皆有骨盆腔疼痛、排尿疼痛、性交疼痛及經痛",
          "correct": true
        },
        {
          "key": "D",
          "en": "endometriois has fever and PID has foul yellow-green vaginal discharge",
          "hant": "子宮內膜異位症有發燒，而PID有惡臭黃綠色陰道分泌物",
          "correct": false
        }
      ],
      "exp_en": "Both disorders have pelvic pain, dysuria (painful urination), dyspareunia (painful intercourse), and dysmenorrhea (painful periods). Endometriosis is caused by an overgrowth of endometrial tissue while PID is caused by a bacterial infection (chlamydia, gonorrhea) or a parasitic infection (trichomonas). It is PID that has both a fever and a foul yellow-green vaginal discharge. ENDOMETRIOSIS: Endometriosis is a non-cancerous disorder in which functioning endometrial tissue is implanted and grows outside the uterine cavity. The extra growth tends to involve the ovaries, large intestine or any of the tissue lining the pelvis. The extra endometrial tissue continues to thicken and bleed with the menstrual cycle. SYMPTOMS include dyspareunia (painful intercourse), dysmenorrhea (painful periods), dysuria (painful urination) or painful bowel movements, menorrhagia (excess menstrual bleeding), palpable masses in the abdomen. DIAGNOSIS is confirmed via a laparoscopy with a biopsy. TREATMENT includes oral contraceptives, danazol, or surgery. Danazol is a medication that lowers estrogen levels and increases androgen levels. This puts the body in a menopausal state. Oral contraceptives help alleviate the pain of endometriosis by suppressing menstruation thereby inhibiting the growth of the extra growth of the endometrial tissue. Treatment can also involve the surgical removal (via laparoscopy) of the extra endometrial growth. PELVIC INFLAMMATORY DISEASE: PID is bacterial diseases that causes an infection of the reproductive organs (uterus, fallopian tubes, ovaries). It is often a complication caused by STDs like chlamydia or gonorrhea. Other infections such as vaginosis can also cause PID. Untreated PID can result in scar tissue or infected abscesses, which can cause permanent damage. SYMPTOMS include fever, lower abdominal pain, dyspareunia (painful intercourse), dysmenorrhea (painful periods), irregular uterine bleeding, and a yellow-green cervical discharge. DIAGNOSIS: There are no specific tests for PID. Diagnosis is usually based on a combination of medical history, physical exam, and other test results such as ultrasound and cervical specimens that look for the presence of gonorrhea, chlamydia or trichomonas. TREATMENT includes antibiotics to treat the underlying infection which can be due to chlamydia, gonorrhea, or trichomonas. If PID is diagnosed early, it can be resolved and PID complications (scar tissue, ectopic pregnancy, infertility, chronic pelvic pain) can be prevented. . The Merck Manual, 18th Edition, page, 2087, 2092; webmd.com",
      "exp_hant": "兩種疾病皆有骨盆腔疼痛、排尿疼痛、性交疼痛及經痛。子宮內膜異位症是由子宮內膜組織過度增生所致，而PID則是由細菌感染（披衣菌、淋病）或寄生蟲感染（陰道滴蟲）所引起。發燒及惡臭黃綠色陰道分泌物則是PID才有的表現。子宮內膜異位症：子宮內膜異位症是一種非癌性疾病，功能性子宮內膜組織植入並生長於子宮腔以外的部位，好發部位包括卵巢、大腸，或骨盆腔內任何組織表面。異位增生的子宮內膜組織會隨月經週期持續增厚並出血。症狀包括性交疼痛、經痛、排尿疼痛或排便疼痛、經血過多，以及腹部可觸及腫塊。診斷須透過腹腔鏡檢查併切片確認。治療方式包括口服避孕藥、danazol（療得高）或手術。Danazol是一種降低雌激素、提高雄激素的藥物，使身體進入類停經狀態。口服避孕藥能藉由抑制月經、進而抑制異位子宮內膜組織的增生，來緩解子宮內膜異位症的疼痛。治療亦可透過腹腔鏡手術切除異位增生的子宮內膜組織。骨盆腔發炎疾病：PID是一種細菌性疾病，會造成生殖器官（子宮、輸卵管、卵巢）感染，常為披衣菌或淋病等性傳染病所引發的併發症，其他感染（如陰道炎）亦可能導致PID。若未經治療，PID可能導致疤痕組織或感染性膿瘍，造成永久性損傷。症狀包括發燒、下腹疼痛、性交疼痛、經痛、子宮不規則出血，以及黃綠色子宮頸分泌物。診斷：目前並無專門檢測PID的特定檢驗，通常依病史、理學檢查，以及超音波和子宮頸檢體（檢測是否有淋病、披衣菌或陰道滴蟲）等其他檢查結果綜合判斷。治療包括使用抗生素治療潛在感染（可能為披衣菌、淋病或陰道滴蟲所致）。若PID能及早診斷，即可獲得治癒，並可預防其併發症（疤痕組織、子宮外孕、不孕症、慢性骨盆腔疼痛）。The Merck Manual, 18th Edition, page, 2087, 2092; webmd.com"
