      "exp_en": "The main actions of the formula are to warm and tonify Kidney yang. In the pattern that the formula treats there is Kidney yang xu with weakness of fire at the gate of vitality. The Kidneys govern the bones and are housed in the lower back. The Kidney channel ascends from the foot and enters the spine to the lower back. A Kidney deficiency is often associated with low back pain and weak lower limbs. From the back a branch of the Kidney channel goes to the abdomen. When the Kidney yang is deficient there will be cold lower extremities and lower abdominal tension. The Kidneys control the movement of water in the body, directing the pure upward and the turbid downward which can result in urinary frequency or difficulty and edema. The water can rebel upward to the Lungs and cause panting and difficulty breathing when lying down. The accumulation and stagnation of water from the yang deficiency results in pale swollen tongue with a thin-white-moist coating. Kidney yang deficiency often manifests as frail or empty pulse that is submerged at the Kidney position. Formulas and Strategies, Bensky, 2nd Edition, page 395",
      "exp_hant": "本方的主要功效為溫補腎陽。此方所治之證為腎陽虛，命門火衰。腎主骨，位居腰府。腎經自足上行，入脊抵腰。腎虛常伴見腰痛與下肢無力。腎經自腰部分出一支循行入腹。腎陽虛則見下肢冷及少腹拘急。腎主水液代謝，升清降濁，腎陽虛衰可致小便頻數或不利及水腫。水氣上逆犯肺，可致喘促、不能平臥。陽虛水液停聚，故見舌淡胖、苔薄白而潤。腎陽虛常見脈弱或虛，且沉取於腎部。Formulas and Strategies, Bensky, 2nd Edition, page 395"
