    {
      "number": 251,
      "question_en": "How is sang ju yin (mulberry leaf and chrysanthemum) modified when there is sore throat?",
      "question_hant": "桑菊飲若兼見咽喉腫痛時應如何加減？",
      "image": null,
      "options": [
        {
          "key": "A",
          "en": "add ma bo (fructificatio lasiosphaerae seu calvatiae) and niu bang zi (fructus arctii lappae)",
