          "hant": "加牛蒡子與黃芩",
          "correct": false
        }
      ],
      "exp_en": "This formula treats early stage wind heat through a slightly dispersing and strongly effusing method that clears while not damaging the fluids like a stonger diaphoretic formula like yin qiao san. The main symptom for this formula is coughing. Although sore throat is one of the main indications for yin qiao san, the modification for this formula in the case of sore throat is to add ma bo and niu bang zi. Ma bo is an acrid lightweight herb that rises to disseminate and disperse wind heat concentrating mostly on the throat and throat disorders. Niu bang zi is a bitter and acrid herb that releases the exterior while clearing internal heat toxin (bitter). It also has an affinity towards the throat. She gan is a very good sore throat herb but more for internal heat toxicity as it is bitter and does not acridly disperse the exterior for wind heat. Huang qin clears lung heat very well but does not disperse the exterior for wind heat. Ju hua acts very similarly to ma bo except that it acts primarily on the lungs and the liver and the eyes in particular. Ge gen is an herb that releases the exterior and releases the muscles (primarily of the tai yang channels). It does not have any specific action for throat disorders. Chinese Herbal Medicine Materia Medica, Bensky, 2004, pg 205, 49, 211, 131, 58, 70; Formulas and Strategies 2nd Edition, Bensky, 2009, pgs 35, 36",
      "exp_hant": "本方治療溫病初起之風熱證，其解表之力較為輕清，發散力強，能清熱而不傷津，不若辛涼重劑如銀翹散那般峻猛。本方的主症為咳嗽。雖然咽喉腫痛是銀翹散的主要適應症之一，但本方若兼見咽喉腫痛，其加減為加入馬勃與牛蒡子。馬勃為質輕之辛味藥，能升散、疏散風熱，作用集中於咽喉及咽喉相關病症。牛蒡子味苦辛，能解表兼清內熱毒（苦味），對咽喉亦有較強的親和力。射干雖為極佳的咽喉腫痛用藥，但更偏重於清內在熱毒，因其性苦，並不具辛散風熱解表之功。黃芩清肺熱效果甚佳，但不具疏散風熱解表之功。菊花的作用與馬勃相似，惟其作用主要偏重於肺、肝及眼睛。葛根為解表、解肌之藥（主要作用於太陽經），對咽喉病症並無特殊功效。Chinese Herbal Medicine Materia Medica, Bensky, 2004, pg 205, 49, 211, 131, 58, 70; Formulas and Strategies 2nd Edition, Bensky, 2009, pgs 35, 36"
