      "exp_en": "This patient exhibits symptoms of Yin excess, with a background of Kidney Yang deficiency: edema and deep body aches concurrent with urinary difficulty. Therefore, zhen wu tang is the most appropriate formula for this condition. It reinforces Kidney Yang to combat overflowing Yin fluids, while also strengthening the Spleen. While shen qi wan does treat urinary issues, it is more purely a Kidney Yang and Qi tonic, with no direct support for Spleen Yang. It is best used in cases with clear deficiency symptoms such as low back pain, weakness, and incontinence. It combines herbs to tonify Yin and Yang as a mechanism for generating Kidney Qi. The formula zhi bai di huang wan treats urinary difficulty due to damp heat in the lower jiao with underlying Kidney Yin deficiency. While this case study does not specify what type of urinary difficulty Harold has, the zhi bai di huang wan pattern would likely include a burning sensation during urination, but without the edema and body aches. The key symptom for this pattern is a flooding pulse in both proximal positions. The formula shen ling bai zhu san treats diarrhea due to Spleen Qi deficiency with dampness. Formulas and Strategies, Bensky, 2nd Edition, page 369, 396, 399 and 744",
      "exp_hant": "此患者表現為陰盛之象，並伴有腎陽虛的背景：水腫與周身痠痛並見小便不利。因此，真武湯是治療此病最適合的方劑。此方溫補腎陽以化氣行水，並兼顧健脾。腎氣丸雖能治療小便問題，但其功用較純粹偏於溫補腎陽與腎氣，並無直接扶助脾陽之效，多用於腰痛、乏力、遺尿等虛象明顯的病例，其配伍陰陽並補之藥以助腎氣化生。知柏地黃丸則用於治療下焦濕熱兼腎陰虛所致之小便不利。雖然本病例未明確說明哈羅德屬於何種小便不利，知柏地黃丸證多伴小便灼熱感，但不會出現水腫與身痛。此證的關鍵徵象為兩尺脈洪大。參苓白朮散則用於治療脾氣虛夾濕所致之泄瀉。Formulas and Strategies, Bensky, 2nd Edition, page 369, 396, 399 and 744"
