      "exp_en": "The main actions of the formula are to drain Stomach heat and nourish yin. The symptoms reflect a pattern of Kidney yin xu with a vigorous Stomach fire. The teeth are associated with the Kidneys and are located along the Stomach yang ming channel. Stomach heat can cause tooth pain while Kidney yin xu can cause loose teeth. In this pattern the bleeding gums are a result of the heat affecting the channels that go to the teeth. Heat in the upper Stomach channel pathway can cause a frontal headache. Irritability, fever, and thirst are produced by the heat. The red tongue with yellow coating and the slippery-large-floating pulse are caused by the Stomach heat. The dry tongue and deficient pulse are a reflection of Kidney yin xu. Formulas and Strategies, Bensky, 2nd Edition, page 179-181",
      "exp_hant": "本方主要作用為清瀉胃熱、滋養陰液。此病機屬腎陰虛而胃火熾盛。牙齒與腎相關，並循行於足陽明胃經。胃熱可致牙痛，腎陰虛則致牙齒鬆動。此證中牙齦出血乃因熱邪影響通往牙齒之經脈所致。上焦胃經熱盛可致前額頭痛。煩躁、發熱、口渴皆由熱邪所生。舌紅苔黃及浮、滑、大之脈象皆由胃熱所致；舌乾及脈虛則反映腎陰虛之象。Formulas and Strategies, Bensky, 2nd Edition, page 179-181"
