      "exp_en": "The formula ma huang tang (ephedra decoction) treats tai yang wind-cold with prevalence of cold. It treats wind-cold at the tai yang stage without sweating. This formula treats severe external wind-cold injuring the protective wei qi which has the result of blocking Lung qi dissemination. The TCM diagnosis is exterior-cold-excess. The formula treats the classic cold injury condition. This formula simultaneously primarily resolves the exterior while secondarily supports the Lungs to descend and disseminate the qi. The chief herb is ma huang which has a very strong diaphoretic action but can also disseminate the Lung qi to treat cough and wheezing. The deputy herb is gui zhi which also has a diaphoretic effect, releases the muscle layer, and warms the channels. ma huang and gui zhi combined together increases the diaphoretic effect of the formula. The assistant herb is xing ren which directs Lung qi downward and assists the chief herb ma huang to stop wheezing and expel exterior wind-cold pathogens. Because xing ren has an oily nature, it moderates the diaphoretic effects of ma huang and gui zhi to help protect the Lungs from becoming dry. The herb treats bleeding (especially epistaxis). CAUTION: Hypertension. Only use formula for a short time. Formulas and Strategies, Bensky, 2nd Edition, page 7",
      "exp_hant": "麻黃湯主治太陽風寒表實證，屬寒重之表證，治無汗之太陽表寒證。此方治療嚴重外感風寒損傷衛氣，導致肺氣宣發受阻。中醫診斷為表寒實證，本方治療典型的傷寒證。此方以解表為主，兼助肺氣肅降宣發。君藥麻黃發汗解表力甚強，亦能宣肺以止咳平喘。臣藥桂枝亦有發汗之效，並能解肌、溫通經脈。麻黃與桂枝相配可增強本方之發汗作用。佐藥杏仁能降肺氣，並協助君藥麻黃止喘、驅散外感風寒之邪。因杏仁質潤，可緩和麻黃、桂枝之發汗之性，有助保護肺臟不致過燥。本藥能治出血（尤其鼻衄）。禁忌：高血壓患者。本方僅宜短期使用。Formulas and Strategies, Bensky, 2nd Edition, page 7"
