      "exp_en": "The formula also treats nosebleed or vomiting blood due to excess heat. It can also treat carbuncles, deep rooted boils, and different types of toxic swellings. The main action of the formula is to drain fire and resolve toxicity. In this pattern the three jiaos are obstructed by fire/heat toxins which pervades both the exterior and the interior. Internal fire toxins can develop when there is an external pathogenic factor becomes transformed by constraint or through the accumulation of internal heat. The fire/heat toxins spread through the the three burners and disturb the mind. This results in high fever, insomnia, and irritability. The fire toxins damage the yin and this results in a dry mouth and throat. In cases of severe heat toxins there can be incoherent speech, and bleeding from the heat agitating the blood. The heat toxins can injure the blood vessels where blood can affect the skin, causing rashes or purpura. When the heat toxins affects the muscle layer there can be carbuncles or boils. The red tongue with yellow coating and a rapid (indicates heat) and forceful (indicates excess) pulse are a reflection of the excess fire toxins. Formulas and Strategies, Bensky, 2nd Edition, page 167",
      "exp_hant": "此方亦可治療因熱盛所致的鼻衄或吐血,亦能治療癰腫、深部瘡瘍及各類熱毒腫痛。此方主要功效為瀉火解毒。此證候為三焦皆被火熱毒邪阻滯,內外皆受波及。當外感病邪因鬱而化熱,或因內熱蓄積轉化,即可形成內在火毒。火熱毒邪流竄三焦,擾亂心神,因而出現高熱、失眠、煩躁。火毒傷陰,故見口乾咽燥。火熱毒邪嚴重時可見譫語,熱迫血行則可致出血。熱毒傷及血脈,血分受累可及於皮膚,發為斑疹或紫癜。熱毒侵及肌肉層則可形成癰腫或瘡瘍。舌紅苔黃、脈數(主熱)而有力(主實)皆反映火熱毒邪熾盛之象。《方劑學》,Bensky著,第二版,第167頁"
