      "exp_en": "This is a classic formula for the excess type of tai yang pattern referred to as cold damage. It is led by ma huang which is an extremely diaphoretic herb that covers most of the therapeutic action needed to treat a cold damage pattern. In the case of wheezing, tight chest, and cough with white and watery sputum, the strategy is to disseminate and direct lung qi downwards. Su zi and chen pi are added to this formula for these purposes. Su zi calms wheezing, dissolves phlegm, and directs qi downwards utilizing an acrid and warm nature. Chen pi transforms phlegm and regulates the middle jiao qi to relieve the diaphragm. This allows for the adjustment of the lung qi back to its proper dynamic. The original modification also includes sang bai pi and fu ling. Sang bai pi helps to arrest coughing and wheezing while fu ling transforms phlegm and aids chen pi in harmonizing the middle jiao. Bai guo is a stabilize and bind herb that preserves the lungs and arrests wheezing. This herb would not be a bad choice for this situation but with sang bai pi, neither subdues rebellious qi. Chuan bei mu alleviates coughing, transforms phlegm and directs lung qi downwards. Ban xia dries dampness, transforms phlegm, and directs rebellious qi downwards. This combination is a fine choice to treat this condition however it does not adjust the middle allowing for the regulation of the qi dynamic of the lungs. Xing ren is in the formula to direct qi downwards to arrest wheezing and aid ma huang in expelling the pathogen. Ma huang is the chief herb of the formula and a very strong diaphoretic which disseminates the lung qi and arrests wheezing. By increasing the dosage of these two herbs, the qi dynamic of the lungs is addressed but the phlegm is not transformed or dissolved. Chinese Herbal Medicine Materia Medica, Bensky, 2004, pgs 446, 510, 891, 378, 413; Formulas and Strategies 2nd Edition, Bensky, 2009, pgs 7,8, 9",
      "exp_hant": "此方為治療太陽表實證(傷寒)的經典方劑。方中以麻黃為君,其發汗解表之力極強,幾乎涵蓋了治療傷寒證所需的主要治療作用。當出現喘咳胸悶、咳吐白色清稀痰時,治療策略應為宣發並使肺氣下降。為此加入蘇子與陳皮。蘇子性辛溫,能降氣平喘、化痰。陳皮能化痰、調理中焦氣機以寬胸利膈,使肺氣得以恢復正常運行。原方加減亦包括桑白皮與茯苓。桑白皮有助止咳平喘,茯苓則化痰並助陳皮調和中焦。白果為斂肺止喘之藥,能固護肺氣、止咳平喘。此藥用於此證並非不當之選,但與桑白皮合用時,二者皆無法平抑上逆之氣。川貝母能止咳化痰、降肺氣。半夏能燥濕化痰、降逆氣。此組合對治療此證是不錯的選擇,但無法調理中焦以恢復肺之氣機。杏仁在方中負責降氣以平喘,並協助麻黃驅邪外出。麻黃為方中君藥,發汗力極強,能宣發肺氣、平喘。加重此二藥劑量雖能調節肺之氣機,卻無法化痰消痰。《中藥學》,Bensky著,2004年,第446、510、891、378、413頁;《方劑學》第二版,Bensky著,2009年,第7、8、9頁"
