      ],
      "exp_en": "Da cheng qi tang treats yang ming organ (fu) syndrome characterized by severe constipation and flatulence, focal distention, abdominal fullness and pain that increase with pressure, a tense and firm abdomen, and a dry yellow or dry black tongue coating with a submerged excessive pulse. This is a strong formula that employs its chief herb da huang to break up abdominal masses, lingering fluids, and accumulations and flush them downwards to regulate the middle and clear the trapped great heat in the yang ming. The other herbs serve to soften and moisten as it breaks up and purges as well as regulate the qi throughout the process. The formula has been used in instances where heat is in excess which damages the fluids and forms clumps which blocks the smooth flow of qi and blood. In cases of irregular menstruation, this formula can be used to clear the excess heat and clumping normalizing the flow of qi and blood and regulating the menstrual flow. Tao he cheng qi tang treats blood build up in the lower burner due to the accumulation of blood stasis and heat. This is commonly attributed to the contraction of an external pathogen directly to the lower burner. The blood stasis and heat buildup cause pain but does not interfere with the transformation of bladder qi and thus the urination remains normal. With heat in the blood, the shen is disturbed and manic behaviors may be seen. The blood stasis may cause amenorrhea or dysmenorrhea in women which can be regulated by moving the blood with this formula. This formula uses the chief ingredients of tao ren and da huang to attack blood stasis and purge heat accumulations respectively. Abdominal pain is a key symptom in the presentation for both of these formulas. Formula and Strategies, Bensky, 2nd Edtion, page 63-66, 559-561",
      "exp_hant": "大承氣湯治療陽明腑實證,其特徵為嚴重便秘與矢氣不通、痞滿、腹脹腹痛且按之加劇、腹部堅硬拒按,舌苔黃燥或焦黑,脈沉實。此為峻猛之方,以君藥大黃攻下腹中積塊、宿液及積滯,使其下瀉以調理中焦,並清除陽明所蘊之大熱。方中其餘藥物則具軟堅潤燥之功,在攻下的同時調理氣機。此方亦用於熱邪熾盛損傷津液、凝結成塊而阻滯氣血運行之證。在月經不調的情況下,此方可用以清除熱結,恢復氣血正常運行,調理月經。桃核承氣湯治療下焦蓄血,乃因血瘀與熱邪蓄積下焦所致,常因外邪直中下焦而形成。血瘀與蓄熱雖引起疼痛,但不影響膀胱氣化,故小便自利。熱在血分,可擾動心神,出現狂躁等症。血瘀亦可導致婦女閉經或痛經,此方可藉活血而調理之。此方以桃仁與大黃為君藥,分別攻逐血瘀與瀉下蓄熱。腹痛為此二方證候的共同關鍵症狀。《方劑學》,Bensky著,第二版,第63-66、559-561頁"
