      "exp_en": "Estrogen-containing agents are used in contraception and in conditions involving estrogen insufficiency. Estrogen agents are posited to be yin-Blood supplementing medicinals which treat symptoms of estrogen deficiency (hot flashes, dry skin, vaginal dryness, low back pain, poor memory, low sex drive, depression, headache). The side effects of estrogen drugs include headache, depression, weight gain, hirsutism, hypertension, thrombosis, and increased risk of breast and uterine cancer. Yin supplementation can cause an excess of Dampness damaging the Spleen-Stomach (nausea, vomiting, weight gain) and Phlegm turbidity (headache, hypertension). The excess Dampness-Phlegm can obstruct the flow of Blood and cause Blood stasis (thrombosis) and breast/uterine cancer (Blood stasis and Phlegm nodulation). The hirsutism is due to the excess of yin-Blood which can grow excess hair. Integrated Pharmacology, Sperber and Flaws, 2007, page 364-365",
      "exp_hant": "含雌激素的藥物用於避孕及雌激素不足相關病症。雌激素類藥物被認為是滋養陰血的藥物,可治療雌激素缺乏的症狀(潮熱、皮膚乾燥、陰道乾澀、腰痛、記憶力減退、性欲低下、憂鬱、頭痛)。雌激素類藥物的副作用包括頭痛、憂鬱、體重增加、多毛症、高血壓、血栓形成,以及乳癌與子宮癌風險增加。滋陰可能導致濕邪過盛而損傷脾胃(噁心、嘔吐、體重增加)以及痰濁上擾(頭痛、高血壓)。過盛的濕痰可阻滯血行,導致血瘀(血栓形成)及乳癌/子宮癌(血瘀與痰結)。多毛症乃因陰血過盛,促使體毛過度生長所致。《整合藥理學》,Sperber and Flaws著,2007年,第364-365頁"
