      ],
      "exp_en": "The formula ma zi ren wan (hemp seed pill) treats yang ming bowel stage with fluid loss from yin deficiency causing thirst and dry stools in aging adults. In \"Discussion of Cold Damage\" this formula treats \"Spleen Bind\" where heat-dryness blocks the transformation and transportation of fluids by the Spleen. The blockage prevents the Spleen from distributing fluids to the extremities and upward to the Lungs and downward to the Intestines. The stools become hard and instead the fluids seep into the Bladder creating increased urination. This formula moistens the Intestines, drains heat, promotes qi movement, and unblocks the bowels. This formula is a variation of xiao cheng qi tang with the dosages of the herbs which purge reduced and herbs that nourish and moisten have been added. The chief herb huo ma ren is oily and moistens the Intestines and unblocks the bowels. The deputy herb xing ren also contains oils that help move qi down and moisten the Intestines. The other deputy herb is shao yao which is bitter, sour, and a little cold. shao yao enters the Spleen, nourishes yin, and harmonizes the interior. The assistant herb zhi shi breaks up Intestinal accumulations. The assistant herb hou po alleviates fullness and distention. The third assistant herb da huang acts as a purgative. The pills are formed with honey which also helps to moisten the Intestines but its main function is to harmonize the action of the other herbs. CONTRAINDICATION: pregnancy. CAUTION: Modify the formula for weak patients or for constipation caused only by Blood deficiency. Formulas and Strategies, Bensky, 2nd Edition, page 81",
      "exp_hant": "麻子仁丸治療陽明腑證兼陰虛津液耗傷,導致老年人口渴及大便乾結。《傷寒論》中此方治療『脾約』,即熱燥阻滯脾之運化及輸布功能。此阻滯使脾無法將津液輸布至四肢及上輸於肺、下達於腸,導致大便變硬,津液反滲入膀胱而使小便增多。此方能潤腸、瀉熱、行氣、通便。此方為小承氣湯的變方,減少了攻下藥的劑量,並加入了滋潤、養陰的藥物。君藥火麻仁質潤,能潤腸通便。臣藥杏仁亦含油脂,有助行氣下降並潤腸。另一臣藥為芍藥,性味苦、酸、微寒,芍藥入脾經,滋陰並調和內在。佐藥枳實能破除腸道積滯。佐藥厚朴能緩解痞滿脹滿。第三味佐藥大黃則具攻下之效。丸劑以蜂蜜製成,亦有助潤腸,但其主要作用是調和諸藥。禁忌:懷孕。注意事項:體虛病人或單純因血虛所致便秘者應調整用方。《方劑學》,Bensky著,第二版,第81頁"
    },
