      "exp_en": "This shang han lun formula is Zhang Zhong Jing's flagship formula from which numerous formulas have been based. This formula classically treats the tai yang wind strike pattern which is a exterior cold pattern with a predominant wind aspect and underlying deficiency. Ultimately, this formula does many things including harmonizing the ying and wei, releasing the muscle layer to promote sweating, and warm the channels for bi syndromes. When there is rough breathing and shortness of breath, qi regulating herbs must be added. Hou po and zhi ke both regulate the qi. The shortness of breath is due to qi stagnation. The obstruction is removed through the aromatic natures of these herbs able to transform dampness and turbidity to reestablish the proper qi dynamic. Ren shen and ge jie both tonify the lung qi but do not regulate and reset the lung qi dynamic. Commonly, ma huang is not appropriate for a gui zhi tang patterned patient due to the underlying deficiency. One of the main symptoms for a gui zhi tang pattern is the presence of sweating. Ma huang is contraindicated with the presence of sweating because it is such a strong diaphoretic it can parch and disperse the body fluids in such patients. Da zao and gui zhi are in the formula to harmonize the ying and wei. This will not regulate the lung qi and therefore is not an appropriate modification. Chinese Herbal Medicine Materia Medica, Bensky, 2004, pgs 470, 479, 710, 768, 3; Formulas and Strategies 2nd Edition, Bensky, 2009, pgs 13 to 18",
      "exp_hant": "此《傷寒論》方為張仲景的代表方劑,後世許多方劑皆以此為基礎發展而來。此方經典地治療太陽中風證,屬外感風寒之表證,以風邪為主要特徵,兼有潛在的正氣虛損。此方最終能發揮多種作用,包括調和營衛、解肌發表以促進發汗、溫通經脈以治痹證。當出現呼吸粗促及氣短時,必須加入理氣藥物。厚朴與枳殼皆能理氣。氣短乃因氣滯所致。透過此二藥的芳香之性,能化濕濁,以恢復正常的氣機運行,從而消除阻滯。人參與蛤蚧皆能補肺氣,但無法調理並重新恢復肺氣的正常運行機制。一般而言,麻黃不適用於桂枝湯證患者,因其存在潛在的正氣虛損。桂枝湯證的主要症狀之一即為汗出。麻黃因禁用於有汗出的情況,因其發汗力極強,可能耗傷並發散此類病人的體液。大棗與桂枝在方中的作用為調和營衛,無法調理肺氣,因此並非適當的加減方式。《中藥學》,Bensky著,2004年,第470、479、710、768、3頁;《方劑學》第二版,Bensky著,2009年,第13-18頁"
