      "exp_en": "Beta-Blockers treat hypertension, migraines, hyperthyroidism, angina pectoris, and myocardial infarctions. From a TCM perspective, Beta-Blockers are posited to be heat-clearing medicinals that clear heat from the Liver and Heart. Hypertension is most often due to a Liver dysfunction (rising Liver yang, Liver Wind, Liver Fire, Phlegm-Heat). Migraines can be due to either Liver repletion counterflowing upward. Hyperthyroidism can be due to depressive heat transforming into fire and consuming the yin. The side effects of Beta-Blockers include the decrease of sexual drive, ejaculation failure, fatigue, cold limbs, insomnia, nightmares, and a slow pulse (bradycardia). If Beta-Blockers cause an excessive clearing of heat they can deplete the yang (chilled extremities, slow pulse, fatigue, reduced libido) and they can affect the ability of righteous qi to help with the formation of Blood (insomnia, nightmares). Beta-Blockers can also worsen angina and cause asthma or congestive heart failure. These side effects are due to the cold nature of this class of drugs draining the Kidney yang which will in turn cause the upper burner to be deficient: the Heart yang to be vacuous (congestive heart failure) leading to an insufficiency of qi to move the Blood (angina) and the Lung qi to not be rooted in the Kidneys (asthma). Integrated Pharmacology, Sperber and Flaws, 2007, page 350-351",
      "exp_hant": "乙型阻斷劑用於治療高血壓、偏頭痛、甲狀腺功能亢進、心絞痛及心肌梗塞。從中醫角度而言,乙型阻斷劑被認為是清熱藥,能清肝心之熱。高血壓多因肝之功能失調所致(肝陽上亢、肝風、肝火、痰熱)。偏頭痛可能因肝實證上逆所致。甲狀腺功能亢進可能因鬱熱化火、耗傷陰液所致。乙型阻斷劑的副作用包括性欲減退、射精障礙、疲倦、四肢冰冷、失眠、噩夢及脈遲緩(心搏過緩)。若乙型阻斷劑造成過度清熱,可能耗損陽氣(四肢冰冷、脈遲、疲倦、性欲減退),並影響正氣協助生血的功能(失眠、噩夢)。乙型阻斷劑也可能使心絞痛惡化,或引發氣喘或充血性心臟衰竭。這些副作用乃因此類藥物性寒,耗傷腎陽,進而導致上焦虛損:心陽虛(充血性心臟衰竭)導致氣不足以行血(心絞痛),以及肺氣不能歸腎(氣喘)。《整合藥理學》,Sperber and Flaws著,2007年,第350-351頁"
