    {
      "number": 441,
      "question_en": "How would shen ling bai zhu san (ginseng, poria, atractylodes powder) be modified for post-partum fever with spontaneous sweating?",
      "question_hant": "參苓白朮散欲治產後發熱自汗，應如何加減？",
      "image": null,
