      ],
      "exp_en": "This formula is a modification of si jun zi tang for qi deficiency when the main symptoms are diarrhea and vomiting or for chronic coughing with copious sputum due to lung deficiency. When post partum fever with spontaneous sweating complicates this pattern dan gui bu xue tang is added (dang gui, huang qi). This formula was created for a pattern of blood deficiency caused by injury to the source qi with the main symptom being fever from deficiency. In this formula, huang qi augments the wei qi and stabilizes the exterior which inhibits the spontaneous sweating. Mu li and long gu can treat both the fever and sweating but they do not fit in with the original intent of the base formula as much as dang gui bu xue tang. Wu wei zi restrains lung qi and tonifies the kidneys but does not support the blood directly. Ren shen is already an ingredient in the original formula so it would not have to be added. Di gu pi clears deficiency heat but does not follow the original intent of the base formula nor does it inhibit sweating. Bai wei cools the blood and promotes urination. This is a good herb for ying level heat entering the blood level. This herb does not have a restraining action and does not support the qi and blood. Chinese Herbal Medicine Materia Medica, Bensky, 2004, pgs 907, 911, 858, 222, 224; Formulas and Strategies 2nd Edition, Bensky, 2009, pgs 314-316, 338",
      "exp_hant": "本方為四君子湯之加減方，用於氣虛而主要表現為腹瀉嘔吐，或肺虛痰多之慢性咳嗽。若此證兼見產後發熱自汗，則加入當歸補血湯（當歸、黃耆）。當歸補血湯本為治療元氣受損所致之血虛發熱而設，方中黃耆能益衛固表，抑制自汗。牡蠣與龍骨雖能治發熱與汗出，然與原方本意之契合程度不及當歸補血湯。五味子能斂肺氣、補腎，然不能直接補血。人參已為原方成分，無需再加。地骨皮能清虛熱，然不符原方本意，亦無止汗之效。白薇能涼血利尿，適用於營分熱入血分之證，然無收斂之效，亦不能補益氣血。《中藥學》，Bensky著，2004年，第907、911、858、222、224頁；《方劑學》第二版，Bensky著，2009年，第314-316、338頁"
    },
    {
      "number": 442,
      "question_en": "After traumatic injury miscarriage, a 28-year-old woman has shortened menstrual cycle for 6 months. She was placed on Xue Fu Zhu Yu Tang (Drive Out Stasis in the Mansion of Blood Decoction) and initially received significant benefit from the formula but its positive effects have tapered off. She has come to your office asking to try a different formula hoping for better results. Her menses currently is heavy, purplish-red in color and contains blood clots, accompanied by pain in the inguinal region, thoracic congestion, distention of the costal regions, distention and pain in breasts, irritability, bitter taste in the mouth, and dry throat. Her tongue is red with thin yellow coating and pulse is wiry, rapid. Which formula would most completely address this patient's condition?",
      "question_hant": "一名28歲女性因外傷導致流產後，月經週期縮短已達6個月。醫者予以血府逐瘀湯治療，初期效果顯著，但療效逐漸減退。她前來就診，希望嘗試其他方劑以獲得更好之療效。其目前月經量多，色紫紅並夾有血塊，伴隨腹股溝疼痛、胸悶、脅肋脹滿、乳房脹痛、心煩、口苦、咽乾。舌紅、苔薄黃，脈弦數。何方最能全面對治此患者之病證？",
      "image": null,
      "options": [
        {
          "key": "A",
