      "exp_en": "The main actions of the formula are to warm the middle burner, dispel cold, promote qi movement, and alleviate pain. The clinical picture needs both warming the Stomach and the promotion of qi movements. The herb gao liang jiang is acrid-warming, enters the Stomach, warms the middle jiao, expels cold, and stops pain. When this herb is washed in wine it increase the dispersing and the unblocking of stagnation. The herb xiang fu is acrid and a little bitter, enters the qi of the Liver and Triple Burner to regulate the qi to unblock stuck qi in all of the 12 primary and eight extra channels. Washing the herb in vinegar limits its acrid and dispersing action from injuring the qi dynamic. Making the pills with ginger juice warms and harmonizes the Stomach. Formulas and Strategies, Bensky, 2nd Edition, page 515, 516",
