      "exp_en": "ENERGETICS: sweet. cool. ORGANS: Stomach, Spleen, Large Intestine. ACTIONS: Clears heat, moves and cools blood stasis, eases pain, harmonizes the uterus and liver (suppressed emotions), promotes urination, reduces swelling. THERAPEUTICS: Treats hot blood (skin disorders with itching and redness, skin ulcers, mastitis, bloody stool, hemorrhoids). Treats edema. Treats canker sores. CONTRAINDICATION: Avoid with cold-type disorders. FOLK REMEDIES: For edema dry the eggplant, grind it, and take one teaspoon in warm water 3x per day. For canker sores charcoal the eggplant and apply locally. Chinese Nutrition Therapy, Kastner, 2004, page 107; Tao of Nutrition, 3rd Edition, page 37",
      "exp_hant": "性味：甘，涼。歸經：胃、脾、大腸。功效：清熱，活血涼血，止痛，調和子宮與肝（情志抑鬱），利尿，消腫。主治：治血熱（搔癢紅腫之皮膚病、皮膚潰瘍、乳癰、便血、痔瘡）。治水腫。治口瘡。禁忌：寒證者應避免食用。民間療法：治水腫，將茄子曬乾研末，每次一茶匙以溫水送服，一日三次。治口瘡，將茄子燒炭研末外敷患處。《中華營養療法》，Kastner著，2004年，第107頁；《營養之道》第三版，第37頁"
