          "en": "xiao chai hu tang (minor bupleurum decoction)",
          "hant": "小柴胡湯",
          "correct": true
        },
        {
          "key": "C",
          "en": "gan mai da zao tang (licorice, wheat, and jujube decoction)",
          "hant": "甘麥大棗湯",
          "correct": false
        },
        {
          "key": "D",
          "en": "da cheng qi tang (major order the qi decoction)",
          "hant": "大承氣湯",
          "correct": false
        }
      ],
      "exp_en": "This is an odd case as there is very little to go on in terms of diagnosis with this young man being generally, in very good health. The symptoms of bitter taste and dry throat are two of the principle symptoms of shaoyang disease and thereby xiao chai hu tang can be effective in treatment. It is possible that these symptoms could have arisen out of a pattern of gallbladder fire. Clinically, it is sufficient to have only one of the classical signs of shaoyang disease to diagnose the level and in this case there are two. Da Cheng Qi tang is for yang ming fu syndrome and the great heat signs and constipation are absent from this young man's presentation. Gan mai da zao tang treats a pattern of heart blood deficiency with liver qi stagnation or the disease zang zao (restless organ syndrome from the jin gui yao lue). The pulse was neither thin nor wiry which would be indicators of this pattern. Liu jun zi tang treats middle jiao deficiency with retention of phlegm-dampness. There is not sufficient evidence for this pattern in this young man. The Clinical Application of Shang Han Lun Formulas, Chen, Rui-Chun, 2009, pgs. 54-55.",
      "exp_hant": "此為特殊案例，因該青年整體健康狀況良好，可供診斷之依據甚少。口苦與咽乾為少陽病之兩項主要症狀，故小柴胡湯可能有效。此症狀亦有可能源自膽火之證型。臨床上，僅需具備少陽病典型症狀之一項即可判定病位，而此案例則具備兩項。大承氣湯用於陽明腑實證，然此青年並無明顯之大熱與便秘等表現。甘麥大棗湯治心血虛兼肝氣鬱結，或《金匱要略》所述之臟躁證，然其脈象既非細亦非弦，不符此證型之指標。六君子湯治中焦脾虛兼痰濕內停，此青年並無足夠證據顯示此證型。《傷寒論方劑臨床應用》，Chen, Rui-Chun著，2009年，第54-55頁。"
    },
