      "exp_en": "The Chief herb is zi su zi. The Deputy herbs is zhi ban xia and hou po. The Assistant herb is chen pi, qian hu, rou gui and dang gui. The Envoy herbs are sheng jiang, da zao, and gan cao. The main actions of the formula are to direct rebellious qi down, arrest wheezing, stop coughing, and warm-transform phlegm-cold. The formula treats both above (redirect rebellious qi down, stop cough and wheezing) and below (warms gate of fire, grasps Lung qi). The chief herb is zi su zi which is acrid-warming-moistening and redirects rebellious qi down, expels phlegm, stops coughing, and stops wheezing. Being a seed, zi su zi has oils which moisten the bowels and assists the Large Intestine and the Lungs. It is a main herb for controlling rebellious Lung qi. The deputy herb zhi ban xia which is acrid-warming-drying combines with the acrid-warming-bitter deputy herb hou po to help the chief herb in its downward directing of qi and in transforming phlegm. The assistant herb chen pi is acrid-warming-bitter assists ban xi to transform phlegm and regulate the qi. The herb qian hu is acrid-bitter and assists hou po in directing qi down and in expelling phlegm. To treat deficiency below there are two other assistant herbs which are rou gui and dang gui. The assistant rou gui warms the fire a the vitality gate, warms cold, and redirects floating yang to its source which helps the Kidneys to grasp the qi. The assistant herb dang gui harmonizes the qi and blood and prevents injury to yin from the acrid-dry herbs in the formula. The envoy are sheng jiang, da zao, and gan cao. The herbs sheng jiang disperses cold and improve Lung qi circulation. The herbs gan cao and da zao harmonize the middle jiao to resolve phlegm and harmonize the actions of the other herbs. Formulas and Strategies, Bensky, 2nd Edition, page 537",
      "exp_hant": "君藥為紫蘇子。臣藥為制半夏、厚朴。佐藥為陳皮、前胡、肉桂、當歸。使藥為生薑、大棗、甘草。此方主要功效為降氣平喘、止咳、溫化寒痰。此方標本兼治：治上（降逆氣、止咳平喘）、治下（溫下焦之火、助腎納氣）。君藥紫蘇子辛溫而潤，降逆氣、祛痰、止咳、平喘。紫蘇子為種子，富含油脂，能潤腸，並助大腸與肺之功能，為治肺氣上逆之要藥。臣藥制半夏辛溫而燥，與辛溫苦燥之臣藥厚朴相配，助君藥降氣化痰。佐藥陳皮辛溫苦燥，助半夏化痰理氣。前胡辛苦，助厚朴降氣祛痰。為治下焦之虛，另有兩味佐藥肉桂與當歸：肉桂溫命門之火、散寒，並引浮陽歸源，助腎納氣；當歸調和氣血，並防辛燥之藥傷陰。使藥生薑、大棗、甘草：生薑散寒、助肺氣宣通；甘草與大棗和中化痰，並調和諸藥。《方劑學》，Bensky，第二版，第537頁"
    },
