      "number": 511,
      "question_en": "Which formula treats the yang ming warp disorder that has an inversion of heat with severely constrained yang qi resulting in the limbs becoming ice cold?",
      "question_hant": "何方治陽明病熱厥證，即陽氣被邪熱嚴重鬱閉，導致四肢厥冷？",
