    {
      "number": 539,
      "question_en": "Which of the following is true regarding the differences between Ren Shen Bai Du San (Ginseng Powder to Overcome Pathogenic Influences) and Jia Jian Wei Rui Tang (Modified Solomon's Seal Decoction)?",
      "question_hant": "關於人參敗毒散與加減葳蕤湯之差異，下列敘述何者正確？",
