      "exp_en": "COMMON: All four herbs activate qi and blood circulation. DIFFERENCES: The herb Chuan Xiong is superior at activating blood circulation, dispelling wind, and relieving pain. It is acrid and warm. It enters the Liver, Gallbladder, and Pericardium channels. The herb Yan Hu Suo strongly activates qi and blood circulation, and effectively relieves pain throughout the entire body. It is acrid, bitter, and warm. It enters the Heart, Liver, and Spleen channels. The herb Jiang Huang strongly breaks up stagnation, regulates qi, and is best for painful obstruction syndrome of the upper limb. It is acrid, bitter, and warm. It enters the Spleen and Liver channels. The herb Yu Jin soothes the Liver, regulates the Gallbladder, dissolves phlegm, and cools blood. It is acrid, bitter, and cold. It enters the Heart, Liver, and Gallbladder channels. CAUTIONS/CONTRA: The herb Chuan Xiong is contraindicated with yin xu fire, red tongue, and dry mouth due to its acrid-warm-dispersing nature. It should be used with caution with hypermenorrhea because the herb has a strong qi and blood activation. The herb Yan Hu Suo is contraindicated during pregnancy. It should be used with caution in treating pain in patients with an underlying deficiency as the herb can consume qi and blood. The herb Jiang Huang is contraindicated during pregnancy. It should be used with caution in deficiency patterns or with patients without blood stasis. The herb Yu Jin is contraindicated in patients without qi and blood stasis or patients with yin deficiency and bleeding. It should be used with caution during pregnancy. DRUG INTERACTIONS: All four herbs should be used cautiously with anticoagulants or antiplatelet drugs as it can increase their effect. Chinese Medical Herbology and Pharmacology, Chen and Chen, 2004, page 673-674, 614, 618, 622, 623",
      "exp_hant": "共同點：四藥皆能行氣活血。差異：川芎長於活血、祛風、止痛；性辛溫，入肝、膽、心包三經。延胡索能強力行氣活血，有效緩解全身各部位之疼痛；性辛苦而溫，入心、肝、脾三經。薑黃能強力破血行氣，最善治上肢痹痛；性辛苦而溫，入脾、肝二經。鬱金能疏肝利膽、化痰、涼血；性辛苦而寒，入心、肝、膽三經。禁忌：川芎因其辛溫發散之性，忌用於陰虛火旺、舌紅口乾者；因其活血行氣力強，月經過多者宜慎用。延胡索孕婦禁用；因其能耗氣血，體虛疼痛患者宜慎用。薑黃孕婦禁用；虛證或無血瘀者宜慎用。鬱金禁用於無氣血瘀滯或陰虛出血之患者；孕婦宜慎用。藥物交互作用：四藥與抗凝血劑或抗血小板藥物併用時皆應謹慎，因其可能增強此類藥物之效力。Chinese Medical Herbology and Pharmacology, Chen and Chen, 2004, page 673-674, 614, 618, 622, 623"
