      "exp_en": "COMMON: All six herbs arrest cough. DIFFERENCES: The herb Xing Ren relieves wheezing, moistens the Lung, and lubricates the bowels. It is bitter and slightly warm. It enters the Lung and Large Intestine. The herb Bai Bu kills parasites and stops both acute and chronic coughs. It is sweet, bitter, and neutral. It enters the Lung channel. The herb Zi Wan moistens dryness, dissolves phlegm. It is bitter, sweet, and slightly warm. Benski does not list zi wan as sweet. It enters the Lung channel. The herb Kuan Dong Hua moistens dryness, dissolves phlegm. It is acrid and warm. It enters the Lung and Heart channels. The herb Pi Pa Ye dissolves phlegm, descends Stomach qi, and is one of the best herbs for sticky, difficult to expectorate phlegm. It is bitter and cool. It enters the Lung and Stomach channels. The herb Bai Guo relieves wheezing and consolidates jing. It is sweet, bitter, astringent, and neutral. It enters the Lung channel. CAUTIONS/CONTRAS: The herb Xing Ren should be used with caution with loose stools. It is not suitable with cough from yin or qi deficiency. The herb Bai Bu is contraindicated with loose stools or Spleen deficiency. The herb Zi Wan is not suitable for cough due to excess heat or yin deficient fire as a single remedy. The herb Kuan Dong Hua should be used with caution with cough due to heat, with Lung abscesses, or pus and blood in the sputum. The herb Pi Pa Ye is not suitable for cough due to cold or from nausea/vomiting due to Stomach cold. The herb Bai Guo is contraindicated in excess patterns or exterior patterns, during the initial stages of cough, and in Lung yin xu with sticky and copious phlegm. It should be used with caution during pregnancy. Chinese Medical Herbology and Pharmacology, Chen and Chen, 2004, page 748, 723, 726, 728, 729, 734, 737",
      "exp_hant": "共同點：以上六藥皆能止咳。差異：杏仁能平喘、潤肺、潤腸通便；性苦微溫，入肺、大腸二經。百部能殺蟲，並止新久咳嗽；性甘苦而平，入肺經。紫菀能潤燥化痰；性苦甘微溫（Bensky未將紫菀列為甘味）。入肺經。款冬花能潤燥化痰；性辛溫，入肺、心二經。枇杷葉能化痰、降胃氣，為治療黏稠難咯之痰最佳藥物之一；性苦涼，入肺、胃二經。白果能平喘、固澀腎精；性甘苦澀而平，入肺經。禁忌：杏仁大便溏瀉者慎用，不宜用於陰虛或氣虛之咳嗽。百部忌用於大便溏瀉或脾虛者。紫菀不宜單味用於實熱或陰虛火旺之咳嗽。款冬花忌用於熱咳、肺癰或痰中帶血膿者，宜慎用。枇杷葉不宜用於寒咳，或胃寒所致噁心嘔吐者。白果禁用於實證或表證、咳嗽初起，以及肺陰虛兼痰黏量多者；孕婦宜慎用。Chinese Medical Herbology and Pharmacology, Chen and Chen, 2004, page 748, 723, 726, 728, 729, 734, 737"
