        }
      ],
      "exp_en": "Three formulas include da huang to purge stagnation and heat in the Large Intestine yangming fu. Common symptoms in three formulas include constipation and abdominal pain that worsens with pressure. The four diagnostic symptoms for Large Intestine yangming heat are 1) distention as increased chest and epigastric pressure, 2) fullness in the abdomen and epigastrium, 3) dryness of stool, and 4) hardness of stool. All three formulas drain heat and accumulation downward. They differ in the degree of potency in accomplishing this action. The formula da cheng qi tang has the strongest potency. It can be used to treat all four symptoms of distention, fullness, dryness, and hardness. The constipation has extremely hard stools. The formula drastically drains heat and accumulation downward. The formula xiao cheng qi tang (minor order the qi decoction) has a moderate to strong potency. It is used to treat qi stasis and symptoms of distention, fullness, and hardness. The constipation has moderately hard stools. The formula gently drains heat and accumulation downward. The formula tiao wei cheng qi tang has a mild to moderate potency. This formula is the mildest out of the three. It mainly softens the stools to treat constipation with dry and hard stools. The formula slowly drains heat and accumulation downward. CAUTIONS/CONTRA: All three formulas are contraindicated with unresolved exterior syndromes, pregnancy, geriatric patients, with yin or qi deficiency or generalized weakness. DRUG INTERACTIONS: The formula xiao cheng qi tang can relieve constipation and nausea from the use of opioids. The formula tiao wei cheng qi tang can counteract the effects of illegal drug overdoses. Chinese Herbal Formulas and Applications, Chen and Chen, 2009, page 156, 157, 159, 193",
      "exp_hant": "三方皆用大黃以攻下腸腑積熱。三方共同症狀包括便秘及按之加劇之腹痛。陽明腑實證之四大辨證要點為：一、痞（胸脘部脹滿感增加）；二、滿（腹部及脘部脹滿）；三、燥（大便乾燥）；四、堅（大便堅硬）。三方皆能瀉熱通腑，惟其力度強弱有別。大承氣湯瀉下之力最強，能同時治療痞、滿、燥、堅四證，其便秘之糞便極為堅硬，能猛烈瀉下積熱。小承氣湯瀉下之力屬中等偏強，主治氣滯所致之痞、滿、堅三證，其便秘糞便硬度中等，能緩和地瀉下積熱。調胃承氣湯瀉下之力屬輕度至中等，為三方中最為緩和者，主要功在軟化糞便以治乾燥堅硬之便秘，並緩慢瀉下積熱。禁忌：三方皆禁用於表證未解、孕婦、老年患者，以及陰虛、氣虛或體質虛弱者。藥物交互作用：小承氣湯可緩解使用鴉片類藥物所致之便秘及噁心。調胃承氣湯可對抗違禁藥物過量所致之影響。Chinese Herbal Formulas and Applications, Chen and Chen, 2009, page 156, 157, 159, 193"
