      "exp_en": "This is the most complete and accurate answer. The suffix -erol in drugs like albuterol (Proventil) refer to bronchodilators (beta-2-agonists) that treat asthma as does theophylline. These drugs interact with substances containing caffeine (coffee, chocolate). Many patients drink grapefruit juice for breakfast which is a time of day when many patients also take medications. Consuming grapefruit any time of the day can cause side effects with prescription drugs. Grapefruit juice is even worse than the fruit, because it is concentrated. Grapefruit juice can interact with many different types of drugs. Grapefruit juice can inhibit the enzyme (CYP3A4) in the small intestine which breaks down (metabolizes) the drug resulting in an increased blood levels of the drug. This increased The amount of the CYP3A4 enzyme in the intestine varies from patient to patient. Therefore, grapefruit juice can affect patients differently even when the same drug is taken. The following classes of drugs interact with grapefruit juice: STATINS (-statin) such as lovastatin (Mevacor), atorvastatin (Lipitor), simvastatin (Zocor). ANTIHISTAMINES (-adine) such as fexofenadine (Allegra). CALCIUM CHANNEL BLOCKERS (-dipine) such as amlodipine (Norvasc), nifedipine (Procardia), and nicardipine (Cardene). BENZODIAZEPINES (-azepam, -zolam) such as diazepam (Valium), midazolam (Versed), and triazolam (Halcion). ANTIARRHYTHMICS (-rone) such as amiodarone (Cordarone, Nexterone, Pacerone). PDE5 INHIBITORS (-afil) such as sildenafil (Viagra), vardenafil (Levitra), and tadalafil (Cialis). Grapefruit can also interact with estrogen-containing oral contraceptive or HRT (hormone replacement therapy). uspharmacist.com; webmd.com; fda.org",
      "exp_hant": "此為最完整且正確之答案。藥物字尾「-erol」，如支氣管擴張劑（乙型-2受體促效劑）沙丁胺醇（Albuterol，商品名Proventil）常用於治療氣喘，茶鹼（theophylline）亦然。此類藥物與含咖啡因之物質（咖啡、巧克力）有交互作用。許多患者於早餐時飲用葡萄柚汁，而此時段亦是許多患者服藥的時間。無論一天中何時飲用葡萄柚，皆可能與處方藥物產生副作用。葡萄柚汁較葡萄柚本身作用更強，因其濃度較高。葡萄柚汁可與多種不同類別之藥物產生交互作用。葡萄柚汁可抑制小腸中代謝藥物之酵素（CYP3A4），導致藥物血中濃度升高。腸道中CYP3A4酵素之含量因人而異，故即使服用相同藥物，葡萄柚汁對不同患者之影響程度亦有所不同。下列藥物類別會與葡萄柚汁產生交互作用：史他汀類（-statin），如洛伐他汀（Mevacor）、阿托伐他汀（Lipitor）、辛伐他汀（Zocor）。抗組織胺藥（-adine），如非索非那定（Allegra）。鈣離子通道阻斷劑（-dipine），如氨氯地平（Norvasc）、硝苯地平（Procardia）及尼卡地平（Cardene）。苯二氮平類（-azepam、-zolam），如地西泮（Valium）、咪達唑侖（Versed）及三唑侖（Halcion）。抗心律不整藥（-rone），如胺碘酮（Cordarone、Nexterone、Pacerone）。第五型磷酸二酯酶抑制劑（-afil），如西地那非（Viagra）、伐地那非（Levitra）及他達拉非（Cialis）。葡萄柚亦可能與含雌激素之口服避孕藥或荷爾蒙補充療法（HRT）產生交互作用。uspharmacist.com; webmd.com; fda.org"
