      "exp_en": "Gan Cao potentiates both prednisolone and cortisol. The constituents glycyrrhizic acid (GL) and glycyrrhetinic acid (GA) inhibits 11beta-hydroxysteroid dehyhydrogenase and A-ring reductases, which then inhibits endogenous cortisol breakdown. When Gan Cao is co-administered with prednisolone, free plasma levels are increased and clearance is significantly decreased. This is also true topically with hydrocortisone creams as well. Because both GL and GA constituents are removed from DGL-type licorice products and these constituents are responsible for aiding in tapering, only whole forms of Gan Cao/Licorice should be used for this purpose. Herb, Nutrient, and Drug Interactions: Clinical Implications and Therapeutic Strategies, Stargrove, Treasure, McKee, 2008, Page 118-9.",
      "exp_hant": "甘草能增強普賴蘇濃（prednisolone）與可體松（cortisol）之藥效。其所含成分甘草酸（glycyrrhizic acid, GL）與甘草次酸（glycyrrhetinic acid, GA）能抑制11β-羥類固醇去氫酶及A環還原酶，進而抑制體內內源性可體松之代謝分解。當甘草與普賴蘇濃併用時，血漿中游離藥物濃度會升高，且清除率顯著降低；此現象於局部外用氫化可體松乳膏亦然。由於去甘草甜素型（DGL型）甘草製品中已移除GL與GA兩種成分，而此二成分正是有助於類固醇減量之關鍵，故僅應使用全甘草（未去甘草甜素）之製品以達此目的。Herb, Nutrient, and Drug Interactions: Clinical Implications and Therapeutic Strategies, Stargrove, Treasure, McKee, 2008, Page 118-9."
