      "exp_en": "This is a case of recognizing that the herbs in si jun zi tang appear in gui pi tang and these herbs are likely the cause of the sensitivity. These herbs also appear in shen ling bai zhu san. Bu zhong yi qi tang has all of si jun zi tang in it except for fu ling but in this case, it is added to make it a likely formula that will cause reaction. Dang gui bu xue tang has huang qi and dang gui in it only and is used to tonify the blood and qi with fever and heat in the muscles. By adding dang shen and more huang qi, the formula is directed to tonify the qi more than the blood and it does not have any of the herbs in si jun zi tang in its ingredients. This would be the best choice. Formulas and Strategies, 2nd Edition, pgs. 353-355, 338-341, 309-321.",
      "exp_hant": "本題須辨識出四君子湯中的藥物同樣出現於歸脾湯中，這些藥物很可能是引發過敏反應的原因。這些藥物同樣也出現於參苓白朮散中。補中益氣湯除茯苓外，含有四君子湯的所有藥物，而在此題中若再加入茯苓，則更可能引發反應。當歸補血湯僅含黃耆與當歸兩味藥，用於治療伴有肌肉發熱之氣血兩虛。若加入黨參並增加黃耆用量，此方將偏重於補氣而非補血，且方中不含四君子湯的任何藥物成分。因此此為最佳選擇。Formulas and Strategies, 2nd Edition, pgs. 353-355, 338-341, 309-321."
