      ],
      "exp_en": "This patient originally contracted an external wind headache which was expelled using the chuan xiong based formula that treats all wind related headaches. Upon the patient's return, his physical condition was apparent and caused by damp-heat in the lower body. The best choice to treat this condition of the choices is er miao san which treats damp-heat in the lower jiao. This is a common formula to treat gouty arthritis with a presentation similar to this patient's presenting symptomology. Du huo ji sheng tang treats pain with liver and kidney deficiency. The pulse and tongue do not indicate that there is a deficiency aspect to the current condition. Er chen tang treats spleen deficiency dampness. This formula does not treat damp-heat but rather dampness or phlegm-damp conditions. Da cheng qi tang treats yang ming organ syndrome and there is no report of any of the four greatnesses (sweat, fever, pulse, thirst) or constipation. Formulas and Strategies, 2nd Edition, Bensky, pgs. 758-759; 775-779; 63-66; 720-721",
      "exp_hant": "此患者原先感受外風而致頭痛，以川芎為主的方劑可袪除各類風邪所致的頭痛而使其緩解。患者再度回診時，其身體狀況顯示為下焦濕熱所致。在這些選項中，最適合治療此病情的是二妙散，能治療下焦濕熱。此為治療痛風性關節炎常用方劑，其表現與此患者的症狀類似。獨活寄生湯治療肝腎不足所致之痺痛。從脈象與舌象來看，並無虛證表現。二陳湯治療脾虛濕盛，此方並非治療濕熱，而是治療濕證或痰濕證。大承氣湯治療陽明腑實證，而此患者並無「四大」（大汗、大熱、脈洪大、大渴）或便秘之表現。Formulas and Strategies, 2nd Edition, Bensky, pgs. 758-759; 775-779; 63-66; 720-721"
    },
    {
      "number": 637,
      "question_en": "You run into an old herbal instructor of yours who asks you how your practice is going. You tell him that your practice is going well and that you are lucky enough to see patients with all types of complaints and many of them being quite complicated. He decides to test you by asking your opinion on a case of his that he had treated recently. He reports to you that a 22 year old pregnant female was in her third trimester and sought herbal help for a swollen face, bad breath, and a burning stomach every time she ate. He prescribed her a small dose of qing wei san (clear the stomach powder). This reduced the swelling, rank breath, and burning sensation in the stomach. She stopped taking the formula when she hit 34 weeks and began feeling heaviness in her arms and legs, occasional acid reflux, and consistent diarrhea. The day after she passed her due date she returned to your office asking for herbal help to prepare the baby to deliver. She presented with the heaviness, reflux, and diarrhea. Her pulse was full and slippery. He told her that he could not prescribe a formula for the purpose of pushing the baby out but that he would recommend a formula for her current condition. Coincidentally, this formula has been used historically for the facilitation of labor. Which formula is your instructor referring to?",
      "question_hant": "您遇到一位過去教您中藥學的老師，他問起您的執業近況。您告訴他執業順利，很幸運能診治各種主訴的患者，其中許多病情相當複雜。他決定考考您，向您詢問他最近治療的一個病例，聽聽您的看法。他告訴您，一名22歲懷孕女性正值妊娠末期，因臉部浮腫、口臭及每次進食後胃部灼熱而尋求中藥治療。他處方小劑量的清胃散，患者的浮腫、口臭及胃部灼熱感均有改善。她在懷孕34週時停止服用此方，之後開始感到四肢沉重、偶爾泛酸，並持續腹瀉。過了預產期一天後，她回診要求中藥協助催生。她當時仍有沉重感、泛酸及腹瀉，脈象洪滑。他告知她，他不能為了催生的目的而處方藥物，但會針對她目前的病情推薦一方。巧合的是，此方在歷史上曾被用於協助分娩。您的老師指的是哪一個方劑？",
      "image": null,
      "options": [
        {
          "key": "A",
          "en": "ba zhen tang (eight treasure decoction)",
          "hant": "八珍湯",
          "correct": false
        },
        {
          "key": "B",
          "en": "da cheng qi tang (major order the qi decoction)",
          "hant": "大承氣湯",
          "correct": false
        },
        {
          "key": "C",
          "en": "ping wei san (calm the Stomach powder)",
          "hant": "平胃散",
          "correct": true
        },
        {
          "key": "D",
          "en": "gui zhi tang (cinnamon twig decoction)",
          "hant": "桂枝湯",
          "correct": false
        }
      ],
      "exp_en": "This is a tricky case as the patient's pregnancy complicates the situation ethically as well as from a treatment standpoint. Her diarrhea suggests that she is suffering from significant dampness. Although acid reflux can be a sign of heat, when it alone appears without other clear heat signs, it can also be a sign of cold dampness in the interior as well. Her condition is likely a condition of cold damp obstructing the middle and ping wei san is the correct choice. Coincidentally, this formula has been used historically for the facilitation of labor. Da cheng qi tang would certainly facilitate labor but without clear yang ming organ heat symptoms, this treatment would ethically be a labor induction. This is not ethical and is contraindicated in this scenario. Gui zhi tang may also serve to move and relax the muscles to help facilitate labor but the pattern of the patient's current condition does not justify the use of this formula. Ba zhen tang is a formula used for dual qi and blood deficiency. In this case, the spleen qi deficiency has led to dampness, but the presence of the sticky herb shu di huang and the cloying nature of major tonification may cause further stagnation and delay the birth. Moreover, there are no specific signs of blood deficiency at this point. Ping wei san is the best choice. Formulas and Strategies 2nd Edition, Bensky, 2009, pages 687-688, 191-192, 63-66, 13-18, 346-348",
      "exp_hant": "此病例較為棘手，因患者懷孕的狀態使治療在倫理與醫療層面上都更為複雜。她的腹瀉顯示體內濕邪明顯偏盛。雖然泛酸可能是熱證的表現，但當其單獨出現而無其他明確熱象時，亦可能為裡寒濕之徵象。她的病情較可能為寒濕阻滯中焦，平胃散為正確選擇。巧合的是，此方在歷史上曾被用於協助分娩。大承氣湯確實能促使分娩，但在缺乏明確陽明腑熱症狀的情況下，使用此治療在倫理上等同於催生，此舉並不符合倫理，於此情境中屬禁忌。桂枝湯雖也可用於行氣活血、放鬆肌肉以助分娩，但患者目前病情的證型並不足以支持使用此方。八珍湯用於氣血兩虛之證。此病例中，脾氣虛已導致濕邪內生，而方中黏膩的熟地黃及大補之品的滋膩特性，可能導致氣機更為壅滯而延遲分娩。此外，目前並無明確的血虛徵象。平胃散為最佳選擇。Formulas and Strategies 2nd Edition, Bensky, 2009, pages 687-688, 191-192, 63-66, 13-18, 346-348"
    },
    {
      "number": 638,
      "question_en": "A 48 year-old female patient presents with dull cramping stomach pain alleviated by pressure and hypochondriac pain for several weeks. Additionally, she has a finicky appetite, and a dry throat and mouth, along with hard dry stools. Her tongue is red and dry with a scanty coat, and her pulse is thready and rapid. The practitioner decides to modify the formula Yi Guan Jian (Linking Decoction) for this patient by combining it with another formula. Which formula would be most appropriate combine it with at this time?",
      "question_hant": "一名48歲女性患者主訴隱隱作痛的胃脘部絞痛，喜按，並伴有脇痛，病程已數週。此外，她食慾不振且偏食，咽喉與口腔乾燥，大便乾硬。舌紅少苔而乾，脈細數。醫師決定將一貫煎與另一方劑合用以加減治療此患者。此時與何方合用最為恰當？",
