      ],
      "exp_en": "Shao yao gan cao tang, comprised by the two herbs in its title helps to nourish the blood and yin while alleviating pain and spasms. Primarily it is used to treat pain syndromes relating to spasms and cramps. The yi guan jian treats the hypochondriac pain as a manifestation of liver qi stagnation and the dryness symptoms while the shao yao gan cao tang will treat the main pain symptoms the patient presents with. Er zhi wan is a yin tonifying formula that is uncharacteristically not cloying. This would help with the dryness symptoms but does not address the pain. Tian tai wu yao san treats pain from qi stagnation and alleviates pain but mostly works on pain that results from cold in the lower abdominal region. With a rapid pulse, this patient does not exhibit signs of cold. Ban xia hou po tang treats liver qi stagnation and phlegm. The dry tongue and lack of phlegm signs would indicate that this formula is not appropriate at this time. Formulas and Strategies, 2nd Edition, pgs. 381-383, 344-345, 527-529, 516-519.",
      "exp_hant": "芍藥甘草湯由方名所示的兩味藥組成，能養血滋陰，兼能緩急止痛，主要用於治療因痙攣、絞痛所致的疼痛證候。一貫煎治療因肝氣鬱結所表現的脇痛及乾燥症狀，而芍藥甘草湯則治療患者所呈現的主要疼痛症狀。二至丸為滋陰方劑，其特殊之處在於不滋膩，有助改善乾燥症狀，但無法針對疼痛治療。天台烏藥散治療氣滯所致之疼痛，能緩解疼痛，但主要作用於下腹部因寒邪所致之疼痛。此患者脈數，並無寒象。半夏厚朴湯治療肝氣鬱結兼痰證，舌乾且無痰象顯示此方於此時並不適合。Formulas and Strategies, 2nd Edition, pgs. 381-383, 344-345, 527-529, 516-519."
    },
    {
      "number": 639,
      "question_en": "A cancer patient is undergoing chemo/radiation treatments and wants to supplement his treatments with herbal therapy. His cancer specialist has suggested that he forego herbal treatment until after completing his chemo/radiation treatment but the patient insists that he would like to utilize herbal medicine to strengthen his immune system. He has done his research and brought you four choices. He asks your professional opinion on which would be best for him. Given the four choices he has brought to you, which of these would you tell him would cause him the least amount of potential harm?",
      "question_hant": "一名癌症患者正在接受化療／放射治療，希望以中藥輔助治療。他的腫瘤專科醫師建議他在完成化療／放射治療前暫緩使用中藥，但患者堅持希望使用中藥來增強免疫系統。他做了研究並帶來四個選項，想聽聽您的專業意見，看哪一個對他最為適合。就他帶來的這四個選項而言，您會告訴他哪一個對他造成潛在傷害的可能性最低？",
