      ],
      "exp_en": "The key here is the radiation treatment. Typically, herbal medicine should be avoided during radiation due to several herbs ability to protect the body from radiation and thereby block their conventional treatment. One of the best herbs to do this is Ren Shen. As one of its adaptogenic qualities, it can protect the body from the harm caused by radiation. During radiation treatment for cancer, this can be interference of the treatment. Of these formulas, only dang gui bu xue tang does not contain ren shen. This formula is a qi and blood tonic that has been used as supportive treatment during radiation treatments. Formulas and Strategies, 2nd Edition, Bensky, pgs. 346-348; 353-355; 317-322; 338-341",
      "exp_hant": "本題的關鍵在於放射治療。一般而言，接受放射治療期間應避免使用中藥，因為部分藥物具有保護身體免受輻射傷害的作用，可能因此阻礙常規治療的效果。其中最具代表性的藥物之一即為人參。人參的適應原（adaptogenic）特性之一，即能保護身體免受輻射造成的傷害。在癌症的放射治療期間，這可能會干擾治療效果。在這些方劑中，只有當歸補血湯不含人參。此方為氣血雙補之劑，已被用作放射治療期間的輔助支持療法。Formulas and Strategies, 2nd Edition, Bensky, pgs. 346-348; 353-355; 317-322; 338-341"
    },
    {
      "number": 640,
      "question_en": "An 18 year-old boy had a car accident a few months ago and was treated with Juan Bi Tang (Remove Painful Obstruction Decoction) for the pain in his neck and shoulders. His pain has left the upper body and has started moving downwards. He now sometimes feels distention or fullness in his abdominal area that increases with anger. Sometimes the pain is severe and stationary and is increased by external pressure. His tongue is purplish with a thin coating and his pulse is wiry or rough. Which formula is the best choice?",
      "question_hant": "一名18歲男孩幾個月前發生車禍，因頸肩疼痛而以蠲痺湯治療。他的疼痛已離開上半身，開始向下移動。他現在有時感到腹部脹滿，且隨怒氣加重。有時疼痛劇烈且固定不移，並因外部按壓而加重。舌質紫暗，苔薄，脈弦或澀。下列何方最為恰當？",
      "image": null,
      "options": [
        {
          "key": "A",
          "en": "Xiao Yao San (Rambling Powder)",
          "hant": "逍遙散",
