          "correct": false
        },
        {
          "key": "C",
          "en": "Xue Fu Zhu Yu Tang (Drive Out the Stasis in the Mansion of Blood Decoction)",
          "hant": "血府逐瘀湯",
          "correct": true
        },
        {
          "key": "D",
          "en": "yue ju wan (escape restraint pill)",
          "hant": "越鞠丸",
          "correct": false
        }
      ],
      "exp_en": "This is an interesting case in that there is both qi stagnation and blood stasis as patterns that this patient is suffering from. The fact that the distending pain that worsens with anger shows that there is a strong pattern of liver qi stagnation but the sometimes severe pain, purplish tongue and sometimes choppy (rough) pulse suggests that blood stasis also is occurring at least some of the time. The formulas xue fu zhu yu tang and yue ju wan both treat qi stagnation and blood stasis. It can be said that yue ju wan treats liver qi stagnation but can address blood stasis because of the presence of chuan xiong while xue fu zhu yu tang is a blood stasis formula that utilizes herbs like chai hu and zhi ke to regulate the qi. For this case, one must consider that blood stasis is the more severe of the two patterns and the more difficult to regulate due to how much more substantial blood is to qi. Therefore, the proper choice in this case is xue fu zhu yu tang. Da cheng qi tang is a yang ming organ syndrome formula treating great heat clumping forming into constipation. This is not appropriate for this patient at this time. Xiao yao san regulates the qi and tonifies the blood but does not move blood. Blood stasis is a clear pattern in this case and therefore this prescription is an incorrect choice. Bensky, Dan, et.al., Formulas and Strategies. Pgs.564, 507, 63, 120",
      "exp_hant": "這是一個有趣的病例，患者同時罹患氣滯與血瘀兩種證型。脹痛隨怒氣加重顯示有明顯的肝氣鬱結證型，但時而劇烈的疼痛、舌質紫暗，以及時而澀滯的脈象則顯示血瘀證亦有部分時候存在。血府逐瘀湯與越鞠丸皆能治療氣滯與血瘀。可以說越鞠丸主治肝氣鬱結，但因方中含川芎，亦能兼顧血瘀；而血府逐瘀湯則為血瘀方劑，並運用柴胡、枳殼等藥物來理氣。就本病例而言，須考慮血瘀是兩者中較嚴重的證型，且由於血較氣更為有形、更難調理，因此更難以處理。故此病例的正確選擇為血府逐瘀湯。大承氣湯為陽明腑實證方劑，治療大熱內結所致之便秘，此方於此時並不適合此患者。逍遙散能理氣並補血，但不能活血。此病例中血瘀證候明顯，因此此處方為錯誤選擇。Bensky, Dan, et.al., Formulas and Strategies. Pgs.564, 507, 63, 120"
    },
    {
      "number": 641,
