      "exp_en": "The formula shen ling bai zhu san is the most appropriate formula for her diarrhea. Given the indications above, she is likely suffering from Spleen Qi deficiency with dampness, which is developing into Lung deficiency. The formula shen ling bai zhu san tonifies Spleen Qi, leaches out dampness, and unblocks Lung Qi. It is superior for treating leakage due to Spleen deficiency, such as chronic diarrhea. Although si jun zi tang also tonifies the Spleen, it would not be as effective in stopping diarrhea. After six weeks, this should be of primary importance. The formula si jun zi tang would be more appropriate for loose stools and weakness due to overwork, a poor diet, or over-worrying. The formula bu zhong yi qi tang treats organ prolapse due to Spleen Qi deficiency, or low-grade fevers due to chronic infection. The formula gui pi tang is best for Spleen Qi deficiency with concurrent Heart Blood deficiency. Indications would include forgetfulness, palpitations, anxiety, and insomnia. This pattern of Spleen qi deficiency would manifest as Spleen not holding Blood, causing chronic bleeding syndromes. Formulas and Strategies, Bensky, 2nd Edition, page 309, 315, 321, and 353",
      "exp_hant": "參苓白朮散是治療她腹瀉最恰當的方劑。根據上述症狀表現，她很可能罹患脾氣虛夾濕，並逐漸發展為肺氣虛。參苓白朮散能補脾氣、滲濕，並宣通肺氣，對於治療因脾虛所致的滑脫，如慢性腹瀉，效果尤佳。雖然四君子湯亦能補脾，但在止瀉方面效果較不理想。經過六週病程，止瀉應為首要考量。四君子湯較適合用於因過勞、飲食不節或思慮過度所致的大便溏瀉與體虛。補中益氣湯治療因脾氣虛所致的臟器下垂，或慢性感染引起的低燒。歸脾湯最適合脾氣虛兼心血虛之證，其表現包括健忘、心悸、焦慮及失眠。此脾氣虛之證型會表現為脾不統血，導致慢性出血證候。Formulas and Strategies, Bensky, 2nd Edition, page 309, 315, 321, and 353"
