      "exp_en": "The Chief herb is ma huang (acrid, slightly bitter). The Deputy herb is gui zhi (acrid, sweet). The Assistant herb is xing ren (bitter, slightly warm). The Envoy herb is zhi gan cao (sweet, warm). This formula treats severe external wind-cold injuring the protective wei qi which has the result of blocking Lung qi dissemination. This formula simultaneously primarily resolves the exterior while secondarily supports the Lungs to descend and disseminate the qi. The chief herb is ma huang which has a very strong diaphoretic action but can also disseminate the Lung qi to treat cough and wheezing. The deputy herb is gui zhi which also has a diaphoretic effect, releases the muscle layer, and warms the channels. ma huang and gui zhi combined together increases the diaphoretic effect of the formula. The assistant herb is xing ren which directs Lung qi downward and assists the chief herb ma huang to stop wheezing and expel exterior wind-cold pathogens. Because xing ren has an oily nature, it moderates the diaphoretic effects of ma huang and gui zhi to help protect the Lungs from becoming dry. zhi gan cao harmonizes the other herbs, moderates the sweating effect of ma huang, and protects the body from the slightly toxic nature of xing ren. Formulas and Strategies, Bensky, 2nd Edition, page 7",
      "exp_hant": "君藥為麻黃（辛，微苦）。臣藥為桂枝（辛、甘）。佐藥為杏仁（苦，微溫）。使藥為炙甘草（甘，溫）。此方治療嚴重外感風寒，衛氣受損，導致肺氣宣發受阻。此方主要功效為解表，兼助肺氣肅降宣發。君藥麻黃發汗力強，亦能宣發肺氣以止咳平喘。臣藥桂枝亦具發汗作用，能解肌、溫通經脈。麻黃與桂枝相須為用，可增強全方的發汗效果。佐藥杏仁能降肺氣，協助君藥麻黃止咳平喘及袪除外感風寒之邪。因杏仁性質滋潤，能緩和麻黃與桂枝的發汗作用，避免肺臟因過度發汗而變得乾燥。炙甘草能調和諸藥，緩和麻黃的發汗作用，並緩解杏仁的輕微毒性。Formulas and Strategies, Bensky, 2nd Edition, page 7"
