    {
      "number": 686,
      "question_en": "A twenty-three year old salesman developed diarrhea while visiting relatives in a foreign country. In the beginning, he suffered from intermittent severe cramps, frequent and urgent evacuation of foul smelling stool, burning pain in the anal sphincter, and bitter taste in the mouth. After returning home, he saw his physician and was prescribed a course of antibiotics. Within a week, the abdominal cramping pain became constant, he lost his appetite, and suffered from vomiting. His pulse which was previously surging, is now moderate. Which of the six channels is the disease now in and what is the cause of this shift in his condition?",
      "question_hant": "一名23歲的業務員在國外探親期間出現腹瀉。起初，他反覆出現劇烈絞痛、大便次數頻繁且急迫、糞便惡臭、肛門括約肌灼痛，並伴有口苦。返家後，他就診並被處方一個療程的抗生素。一週之內，他的腹部絞痛變為持續性，食慾不振，並出現嘔吐。他先前的脈象為洪脈，現已轉為緩脈。此病現處於六經中的哪一經，導致此病情轉變的原因為何？",
