      "exp_en": "When ethanol is metabolized into acetaldehyde, the constituent of Ge Gen, daidzin can effectively inhibit aldehyde dehydrogenase (in vitro). A small human trial of chronic beer drinkers found that 3g of Ge Gen daily for one week caused significantly reduced beer intake during a 1.5 hr observed session. Total volume and size of each sip decreased. In a larger study of 300 alcohol abusers, 80% no longer experienced alcohol cravings after 2-4 weeks of intake with no adverse effects (no dose listed). However, another small study showed no reduction in alcohol craving in those receiving 2.4g daily. Herbal Contraindications and Drug Interactions plus Herbal Adjuncts with Medicines, Brinker, 2010, Page 222.",
      "exp_hant": "當乙醇代謝為乙醛時，葛根的成分葛根素（daidzin）能有效抑制乙醛去氫酶（體外實驗）。一項針對長期飲用啤酒者的小型人體試驗發現，每日服用3克葛根連續一週，在1.5小時的觀察期間內顯著減少啤酒攝取量，總飲用量及每口飲用量皆減少。在一項納入300名酗酒者的較大型研究中，80%的受試者於服用2至4週後不再有飲酒渴求，且無不良反應（未列出劑量）。然而，另一項小型研究顯示，每日服用2.4克並未減少對酒精的渴求。Herbal Contraindications and Drug Interactions plus Herbal Adjuncts with Medicines, Brinker, 2010, Page 222."
