    {
      "number": 714,
      "question_en": "Which herb may have positive ionotropic and chronotropic effect and should be used with extreme caution on patients taking antiarrhythmic medications?",
      "question_hant": "何種中藥可能具有正性肌力（ionotropic）及正性變時（chronotropic）作用，對於服用抗心律不整藥物的患者應極為謹慎使用？",
      "image": null,
      "options": [
        {
          "key": "A",
          "en": "chen pi (citri reticulatae pericarpium)",
          "hant": "陳皮",
          "correct": false
        },
        {
          "key": "B",
          "en": "ge gen (peureriae radix)",
          "hant": "葛根",
          "correct": false
        },
        {
          "key": "C",
          "en": "huang qi (astragali radix)",
          "hant": "黃耆",
          "correct": false
