      "number": 718,
      "question_en": "A 46 year-old female comes to your office looking for support/help with weight loss. She obtained an OTC supplement in Tijuana containing 12mg Ephedra extract and 48mg of Caffeine. What are your concerns?",
      "question_hant": "一位46歲女性至你的診所尋求減重方面的協助。她在提華納（Tijuana）購得一款成藥保健品，內含12毫克麻黃萃取物及48毫克咖啡因。你會有何顧慮？",
