      "exp_en": "The effects of ephedrine on weight loss are potentiated by caffeine. While the combination of the two were shown to moderately increase weight loss, separately, they show little to no effect. In a study of the above listed combination (12mg Ephedra extract and 48mg caffeine), a single dose caused prolongation of QTc interval, with torsades de pointes arrhythmia. The synergy of the two drugs at a significant dosage for weight loss is largely offset by an increase of adverse effects: palpitations, tachycardia, nausea, agitation and insomnia. Advise the patient to discontinue use. Herb, Nutrient, and Drug Interactions: Clinical Implications and Therapeutic Strategies, Stargrove, Treasure, McKee, 2008, Page 44.",
      "exp_hant": "麻黃素對減重的效果會因咖啡因而增強。雖然兩者合併使用時顯示可適度增加減重效果，但個別使用時效果甚微或無效。在一項針對上述組合（12毫克麻黃萃取物與48毫克咖啡因）的研究中，單次劑量即造成QTc間期延長，並出現尖端扭轉型心律不整。兩種藥物在達到有效減重劑量下的協同作用，很大程度上被不良反應的增加所抵銷：心悸、心搏過速、噁心、躁動及失眠。建議病患停止使用。Herb, Nutrient, and Drug Interactions: Clinical Implications and Therapeutic Strategies, Stargrove, Treasure, McKee, 2008, Page 44."
