          "en": "The claims are unsupported. Dang Gui (radix angelicae sinensis ) has not been shown to have any estrogenic compounds, nor does it cause estrogenic effects such as an increase in endometrial thickness.",
          "hant": "此說法並無依據。當歸並未被證實含有任何雌激素樣成分，亦未顯示會產生雌激素效應，例如子宮內膜增厚",
