    {
      "number": 722,
      "question_en": "Which of the following may potentiate cholesterol lowering agents and anticoagulants and may lower plasma glucose levels?",
      "question_hant": "下列何者可能增強降膽固醇藥物及抗凝血劑的效果，並可能降低血漿葡萄糖濃度？",
