      ],
      "exp_en": "This is the most complete and accurate answer. Licorice has no known interactions with ciprofloxacin (treats infections), levodopa (treats Parkinson's) or albuterol (treats asthma). However, licorice has a strong interaction with the anticoagulant warfarin (Coumadin). Licorice contains glycyrrhizin which may increase the breakdown of warfarin and decrease its effectiveness and increase the risk of clotting. Licorice has a moderate interaction with digoxin (Lanoxin) which treats heart failure, estradiol and other estrogen drugs, and furosemide (Lasix) which treats edema and high blood pressure. Licorice acts like an estrogen and can thus interact with estrogen drugs. Licorice can raise blood pressure and can thus interact with blood pressure drugs. Licorice removes potassium from the body and can thus interact with diuretics. Even with patients not on warfarin, eating large daily amounts of 5 grams or more of licorice can have severe side effects such as high blood pressure, low blood potassium levels, weakness, irregular heart rhythms, and a heart attack. Patients who consume lots of salt, have heart or kidney disease or hypertension are more sensitive to licorice even in small amounts. High intake of licorice during pregnancy (250g per week) may increase the risk of early delivery or a miscarriage. NOTE: Many \"licorice\" products manufactured in the US actually do not actually contain glycyrrhizin. They are called \"black licorice\" containing anise, the characteristic smell and taste of licorice. webmd.com",
      "exp_hant": "此為最完整且準確的答案。甘草與環丙沙星（治療感染）、左旋多巴（治療帕金森氏症）或沙丁胺醇（治療氣喘）並無已知的交互作用。然而，甘草與抗凝血劑華法林（Coumadin）具有強烈的交互作用。甘草含有甘草酸，可能加速華法林的代謝，降低其療效並增加凝血風險。甘草與地高辛（Lanoxin，治療心衰竭）、雌二醇及其他雌激素類藥物，以及呋塞米（Lasix，治療水腫及高血壓）具有中度交互作用。甘草作用類似雌激素，因此可能與雌激素類藥物產生交互作用。甘草可能升高血壓，因此可能與降血壓藥物產生交互作用。甘草會使體內鉀流失，因此可能與利尿劑產生交互作用。即使未服用華法林的病患，若每日大量食用5公克以上的甘草，也可能出現嚴重副作用，如高血壓、低血鉀、乏力、心律不整及心臟病發作。攝取大量鹽分、患有心臟病、腎臟病或高血壓的患者，即使少量甘草也較為敏感。懷孕期間大量攝取甘草（每週250克）可能增加早產或流產風險。註：許多美國製造的「甘草」產品實際上並不含甘草酸，這類產品稱為「黑甘草」，含有八角茴香，具有甘草特有的氣味與口感。webmd.com"
    },
