      "exp_en": "Anti-psychotic drugs or neuroleptics are prescribed to treat schizophrenia and psychoses, nausea and vomiting, and Tourette's syndrome (spasms and contractures). From a TCM perspective these western drugs are posited to be heavy, settling spirit-calming medicinals. As these drugs treat nausea and vomiting (counterflow of Stomach qi), spasms and contractions (Liver Wind or hyperactive Liver yang), and schizophrenia and psychoses (upward counterflowing yang). The side effects of this class of drugs includes, tremors, blurry vision, dry mouth, infertility, impotence, fatigue, orthostatic hypotension, tardive dyskinesia, somnolence, confusion, constipation, urinary retention, amenorrhea, and galactorrhea. Heavy, settling spirit-calming medicinals can injure Spleen qi (fatigue, somnolence, hypotension). When the qi is weak there can be urinary retention due to the qi unable to move fluids and galactorrhea due to an insufficiency of qi unable to contain fluids. Impotence can also be seen as resulting from qi vacuity. When the Spleen qi is injured it can also lead to Blood vacuity (amenorrhea, infertility, blurred vision, dry mouth, confusion, constipation). When the Blood is in a state of vacuity, internal wind can stir (involuntary movements of tardive dyskinesia). Integrated Pharmacology, Sperber and Flaws, 2007, page 356-357",
      "exp_hant": "抗精神病藥物（神經阻斷劑）用於治療精神分裂症與精神病、噁心嘔吐，以及妥瑞氏症（抽搐與攣縮）。從中醫角度而言，此類西藥可被視為重鎮安神藥。因為此類藥物可治療噁心嘔吐（胃氣上逆）、抽搐攣縮（肝風或肝陽亢盛），以及精神分裂症與精神病（陽氣上逆）。此類藥物的副作用包括震顫、視力模糊、口乾、不孕、陽痿、疲倦、姿勢性低血壓、遲發性運動障礙、嗜睡、意識混亂、便秘、尿滯留、閉經及泌乳異常。重鎮安神藥可損傷脾氣（疲倦、嗜睡、低血壓）。當氣虛弱時，可因氣不能運化津液而致尿滯留，亦可因氣虛不能固攝津液而致泌乳異常。陽痿亦可視為氣虛所致。當脾氣受損時，亦可導致血虛（閉經、不孕、視力模糊、口乾、意識混亂、便秘）。當血處於虛弱狀態時，內風可因而妄動（遲發性運動障礙的不自主動作）。Integrated Pharmacology, Sperber and Flaws, 2007, page 356-357"
