    {
      "number": 737,
      "question_en": "A 32 year-old college student comes to you for treatment and reports being run down by her final exams which ended a few days ago. She reports not being able to shake the anxiety that she had throughout the whole exams week as well as fatigue which she blames on her irregular diet due to \"studying all of the time\". She feels tired, feverish, and has no motivation to engage socially. In addition, she began her menstrual period two days ago and has had uncharacteristically painful menses with purple clots. Her pulse is thin and choppy and her tongue is pale but dusky. How would you modify the formula Gui Pi Tang (Restore the Spleen Decoction) for this patient's current condition?",
      "question_hant": "一位32歲大學生因幾天前結束的期末考而感到身心俱疲前來就診。她表示整個考試週皆處於無法擺脫的焦慮狀態，並因「一直在唸書」而飲食不規律導致疲勞。她感到疲倦、發熱，且沒有社交意願。此外，她的月經於兩天前來潮，經血異常疼痛且夾有紫色血塊。其脈細澀，舌淡而暗。針對此患者目前的病情，你會如何加減歸脾湯？",
      "image": null,
      "options": [
        {
          "key": "A",
          "en": "Add yu jin (radix curcumae) and xiang fu (rhizoma cyperi)",
          "hant": "加鬱金、香附",
          "correct": true
        },
        {
          "key": "B",
          "en": "Add shan zhu yu (fructus corni) and wu wei zi (fructus schisandrae)",
          "hant": "加山茱萸、五味子",
          "correct": false
        },
        {
          "key": "C",
          "en": "Add qiang huo (rhizoma notopterygii) and chuan xiong (rhizoma chuanxiong)",
          "hant": "加羌活、川芎",
          "correct": false
        },
        {
          "key": "D",
          "en": "Remove long yan rou (arillus longan) and dang gui (radix angelicae sinensis)",
          "hant": "去龍眼肉、當歸",
          "correct": false
        }
      ],
      "exp_en": "This patient is suffering from qi and blood deficiency from damage to both the spleen and heart due to her stress and strain from her final exams. Excessive taxation and deliberation has caused damage to the spleen resulting in loss of blood production which in turn fails to nourish the heart. The spleen qi and heart blood deficiency points to the prescription gui pi tang. Due to her additional symptoms of painful menses with clots, yu jin and xiang fu are the correct herbs to add to this formula for their ability to regulate the liver and the blood (and qi). Qiang huo and chuan xiong are added to the formula for cases in which there is numbness in the upper extremities accompanying the root pattern. Shan zhu yu and wu wei zi are added to gui pi tang when there is copious and continuous menstrual flow. This case shows blood stasis and there is no report of profuse and continuous menstrual flow. Long yan rou is in the formula for its ability to tonify the blood while calming the shen. With this patient's persistent anxiety, this herb is useful to remain in the formula. Dang gui is one of the main blood tonifiers of the formula while also mildly regulating the blood which can be useful with the presence of blood clots. Formulas and Strategies 2nd Edition, Bensky, 2009, pages 353-355",
      "exp_hant": "此患者因期末考造成的壓力與勞累而傷及脾心，導致氣血兩虛。過度勞心思慮損傷脾臟，使氣血生成不足，進而無法濡養心臟。脾氣與心血兩虛的證候指向歸脾湯這一處方。由於她另有經行疼痛夾血塊的症狀，鬱金與香附是正確加入此方的藥物，以疏肝理血（兼理氣）。羌活與川芎則用於本方所治病機兼見上肢麻木的情況。山茱萸與五味子則用於歸脾湯中經血量多且淋漓不止的情形。此病例呈現血瘀之象，並無經量過多且持續不止的記載。龍眼肉在方中具有補血兼安神的作用。就此患者持續存在的焦慮而言，此藥應予保留於方中。當歸為本方主要的補血藥之一，同時能輕微理血，有助於改善血塊的情況。Formulas and Strategies 2nd Edition, Bensky, 2009, pages 353-355"
    },
    {
      "number": 738,
      "question_en": "A 60 year-old patient of yours reports a history of hypertension for 10 years. Two days ago, he argued with his boss and got upset. He was prescribed Xiao Yao San (Rambling Powder) by your colleague which helped slightly but he has come to you to ask for a second opinion. Now his blood pressure is 186/135 mm hg, and he complains of dizziness and vertigo, distending pain of headache and eyes, irritability, red complexion, bloodshot eyes, dry bitter taste in mouth, yellow urine, and constipation. His tongue is red with yellow coating and pulse is rapid and wiry. With all due respect to your colleague, what would you prescribe to this patient for his current condition?",
      "question_hant": "你的一位60歲患者有十年高血壓病史。兩天前他與上司爭執並動怒。你的同事為他開立逍遙散，症狀稍有改善，但他前來向你尋求第二意見。目前他的血壓為186/135毫米汞柱，並主訴頭暈目眩、頭痛及眼睛脹痛、易怒、面赤、目赤、口乾口苦、尿黃及便秘。舌紅苔黃，脈弦數。在充分尊重你同事的意見下，你會為此患者目前的病情開立何方？",
