      "exp_en": "This condition has changed in the two days since the original prescription was given. In that time, the pattern has changed to a pattern of liver yang rising. The heat rushing to the head with the wiry pulse and vertigo suggest this new pattern. For this pattern, the formula tian ma gou teng yin is indicated. The hyperactive liver yang leads to the internal stirring of liver wind leading to the bouts of vertigo. It is possible that the excessive exposure to the sun for the last two days damaged the liver yin leading to this condition. Huang lian e jiao tang treats heat excess with blood deficiency. This is associated with the shao yin level of the six stages and treat the serious condition where the heart and kidney lose communication. This is not the correct pattern for this case. Suan zao ren tang treat deficiency conditions (xu lao and xu fan) where a deficiency of the liver leads to heat rising to and disturbing the heart. This is a common formula prescribed for poor sleep (insomnia), but it would not be correct for this case. Dang gui liu huang tang treats night sweating due to fire raging in the interior with an underlying blood and yin deficiency. Night sweats is not a factor in this case and the pattern is not correct for the use of this formula. Formulas and Strategies 2nd Edition, Bensky, 2009, pages 811-812, 647-649, 469-470, 462-465, 218-220",
      "exp_hant": "此病情自最初處方後的兩天內已有變化。在這段期間，證候已轉變為肝陽上亢。熱氣上衝頭部伴隨弦脈與眩暈，提示此新證候。針對此證候，天麻鉤藤飲為適用之方。肝陽亢盛導致內風妄動，引發陣發性眩暈。過去兩天過度曝曬陽光，可能已損傷肝陰而導致此病情。黃連阿膠湯治療熱盛兼血虛，屬六經辨證中少陰病層次，治療心腎不交的嚴重病症。此證候並不符合本病例。酸棗仁湯治療虛勞虛煩之證，肝之陰血不足導致熱擾於上並擾及心神。此方為治療失眠的常用方劑，但並不適用於本病例。當歸六黃湯治療陰血不足、內火熾盛所致盜汗。本病例並無盜汗症狀，故此方證候並不相符。Formulas and Strategies 2nd Edition, Bensky, 2009, pages 811-812, 647-649, 469-470, 462-465, 218-220"
    },
    {
      "number": 740,
      "question_en": "A 27 year old white female has a diagnosis of Chronic Fatigue Immune Deficiency Syndrome (CFIDS). Lab tests comprehensive metabolic panel, CBC, UA, TSH, free T3, and free T4 are normal, ESR elevated, ANA is negative. HIV is negative. RA factor is negative. EBV serology is negative. She is on Lodine 500 mg bid. Her symptoms include extreme fatigue all day long which started on April 26, two years ago. Other symptoms include unexplained general muscle weakness, forgetfulness and arthralgias. She has lost her ability to concentrate. She has mood swings, palpitations, and a faint weak voice. For the past two days she has sore, swollen lymph nodes, fever, sweating, muscle aches, and fatigue. Physical examination shows a 27 year old woman with generalized muscle pain, non-specific joint pain, confusion, and marked swelling of the lymph nodes. The pulse is slightly fast. Temperature is 38.2 C. Which herbs would you add to xiao chai hu tang (minor bupleurum decoction) to treat the marked swelling of the lymph nodes?",
      "question_hant": "一位27歲白人女性被診斷為慢性疲勞免疫功能失調症候群（CFIDS）。實驗室檢查包括綜合代謝套組、全血球計數（CBC）、尿液分析（UA）、TSH、游離T3及游離T4皆正常，紅血球沉降速率（ESR）偏高，抗核抗體（ANA）為陰性。HIV陰性。類風濕因子陰性。EB病毒血清學檢查陰性。她目前服用Lodine 500毫克，每日兩次。其症狀包括整天持續的極度疲勞，始於兩年前的4月26日。其他症狀包括不明原因的全身肌肉無力、健忘及關節痛。她已喪失專注能力。她有情緒起伏、心悸及聲音低弱無力的情形。過去兩天她出現淋巴結腫痛、發熱、盜汗、肌肉痠痛及疲倦。理學檢查顯示這位27歲女性有全身肌肉疼痛、非特異性關節疼痛、意識混亂，以及明顯的淋巴結腫大。脈象略數。體溫38.2°C。若要在小柴胡湯的基礎上加減以治療明顯的淋巴結腫大，你會加入哪些藥物？",
      "image": null,
      "options": [
