      ],
      "exp_en": "The diagnosis is Interior Vacuity-Exterior Repletion Pattern. Xiao chai hu tang is a classical formula used primarily for Shao Yang syndrome. Lymph node swelling in TCM is often associated with phlegm accumulation, heat-toxin, qi stagnation, or a combination of these, often secondary to an unresolved pathogenic invasion or chronic internal disharmony. Xiao chai hu Tang addresses the Shao Yang disharmony, but additional herbs are needed to specifically target phlegm and heat-toxin causing lymph node swelling. Zhe bei mu clears heat and dissipates nodules. It is well known for resolving phlegm-heat nodules, including swollen lymph nodes, scrofula, and abscesses. It softens hardness and breaks up accumulations. It moistens and transforms phlegm. It addresses sticky phlegm that contributes to localized swellings.Xia ku cao Clears Liver fire and dissipates nodules. It is effective for swellings, goiters, and lymph node enlargements caused by Liver fire or heat-toxin. The herb also Drains heat and resolves toxicity. It cools and detoxifies, addressing underlying heat-toxin contributing to inflammation and swelling. The Treatment of Modern Western Medical Diseases with Chinese Medicine, Flaws, 2nd Edition, page 148",
      "exp_hant": "此診斷屬於裡虛表實證。小柴胡湯是主要用於少陽病證的經典方劑。中醫認為淋巴結腫大常與痰積、熱毒、氣滯或此三者的合併有關，通常繼發於未解的病邪侵襲或慢性內在失調。小柴胡湯針對少陽不和進行治療，但仍需加入其他藥物，以特別針對造成淋巴結腫大的痰與熱毒。浙貝母清熱散結，素以化解痰熱結節聞名，包括淋巴結腫大、瘰癧及癰腫。它能軟堅散結，並能潤肺化痰，針對造成局部腫脹的黏膩痰邪。夏枯草清肝火、散結節，對於肝火或熱毒所致的腫脹、癭瘤及淋巴結腫大有效。此藥亦能瀉熱解毒，清熱解毒以針對造成發炎腫脹的潛在熱毒。The Treatment of Modern Western Medical Diseases with Chinese Medicine, Flaws, 2nd Edition, page 148"
