    {
      "number": 741,
      "question_en": "A patient treated with Xiao Cheng Qi Tang's (minor order the qi decoction) condition changes after two days of taking the formula. They arrive to your office at this time reporting the following symptoms: constipation, thirst, fever. There is no abdominal distention or fullness in the epigastrium. The tongue is red with a dry, yellow fur. The pulse is rapid and deep. Which formula would you use now?",
      "question_hant": "一位以小承氣湯治療的患者，在服藥兩天後病情發生變化。此時她前來你的診所，主訴以下症狀：便秘、口渴、發熱。並無腹脹或胃脘部脹滿。舌紅苔黃而乾，脈數而沉。你現在會使用何方？",
