        {
          "key": "C",
          "en": "Add Lai Fu Zi (semen raphani)",
          "hant": "加萊菔子",
          "correct": false
        },
        {
          "key": "D",
          "en": "Keep the formula the same and increase the dosage",
          "hant": "維持原方不變並增加劑量",
          "correct": false
        }
      ],
      "exp_en": "This is a case of mistreatment during a shaoyang syndrome in which the treatment for a yangming organ syndrome is employed incorrectly. The formula ban xia xie xin tang is indicated for the improper purging of a half interior / exterior pathogen with underlying spleen deficiency. The presentation includes epigastric focal distention, fullness, and tightness with none or minimal pain. By purging the shaoyang pathogen, the pathogen is not expelled and the yang qi is further damaged in the middle leading to the clumping of heat and cold. Lai fu zi is a modification for da cheng qi tang in instances of severe abdominal distention. Keeping da cheng qi tang is inappropriate in this case as the distention is not painful with pressure. There are also no signs of yangming heat or constipation. Tao ren and chi shao are added in the presence of blood stasis which does not have evidence for in this case. Formulas and Strategies, 2nd Edition, pgs. 63-66, 127-130.",
      "exp_hant": "此為少陽病證中誤用陽明腑證攻下法治療所致之病例。半夏瀉心湯適用於半表半裡病邪誤下後，兼有脾虛的情況。其表現包括胃脘部局部脹滿、痞滿及緊繃感，且疼痛輕微或無痛。誤下少陽病邪，非但邪氣未除，反而更損中焦陽氣，導致寒熱互結。萊菔子是大承氣湯於腹脹嚴重時的加減用藥。本病例中繼續使用大承氣湯並不恰當，因其脹滿並非按之疼痛，亦無陽明熱證或便秘的徵象。桃仁與赤芍則於有血瘀證據時加入，本病例並無此證據。Formulas and Strategies, 2nd Edition, pgs. 63-66, 127-130."
    },
    {
      "number": 760,
      "question_en": "A patient with a wind-cold invasion was treated incorrectly with Yin Qiao San (Honeysuckle and Forsythia Powder). The patient took the incorrect formula for a week before coming to you to inquire as to why they were not feeling better. The patient currently complains of heartburn, dizziness, dry throat, a sour taste in the mouth, and feeling hot and cold. Upon further inquiry, it is noted that the patient also suffers from nausea, some vomiting, and a feeling of fullness in the chest. The pulse is wiry and the tongue is pink with a thin, white coat. Which formula is indicated for this patient?",
      "question_hant": "一位風寒外感患者被誤以銀翹散治療。患者服用此誤用之方一週後，前來就診詢問為何症狀未見好轉。患者目前主訴心口灼熱感、頭暈、咽乾、口中泛酸，以及寒熱交替之感。進一步詢問後得知，患者亦有噁心、輕度嘔吐，以及胸悶感。脈弦，舌淡紅苔薄白。此患者應選用何方？",
      "image": null,
      "options": [
