      "exp_en": "Tonifying the yang formulas without zhi fu zi are not common. In the cases of jin gui shen qi wan, you gui wan, and you gui yin, zhi fu zi is an important component in each. Although er xian tang treats a dual kidney yin/yang deficiency, yang tonics such as yin yang huo, xian mao, and ba ji tian are used to warm the kidney yang in the absence of aconite. Formulas and Strategies, 2nd Edition, Bensky, pgs. 395-400; 401-402; 410-411",
      "exp_hant": "不含附子的補陽方劑並不常見。在金匱腎氣丸、右歸丸及右歸飲的組成中，附子皆為重要成分。雖然二仙湯治療腎陰陽兩虛，但方中使用淫羊藿、仙茅及巴戟天等溫陽藥物，在不使用附子的情況下溫補腎陽。Formulas and Strategies, 2nd Edition, Bensky, pgs. 395-400; 401-402; 410-411"
    },
    {
      "number": 762,
      "question_en": "A patient with a history of brain trauma was put on Xiao Huo Luo Dan (Minor Invigorate the Collaterals Special Pill) for hemiplegia following a stroke six months ago. This patient made no lifestyle changes and suffered another incident two weeks ago. He has since left the hospital and arrived at your clinic complaining of involuntary salivation, urinary incontinence, and muscle atrophy. He presents with deviation of the mouth, slurred speech, and a moderate pulse. What formula is indicated to address this patient's current complaints and presentation?",
      "question_hant": "一位有腦部外傷病史的患者，因六個月前中風後偏癱而服用小活絡丹。此患者未做任何生活方式的改變，於兩週前再度發病。他出院後前來你的診所，主訴不自主流涎、尿失禁及肌肉萎縮。他表現出口角歪斜、言語不清及脈緩。針對此患者目前的主訴與表現，應選用何方？",
      "image": null,
      "options": [
